<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">RRK44.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">YOHAANA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Engiri Nk'oku Yaahandiikirwe Yohaana</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yohaana</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoh</para>
  <para style="mt2">ENGIRI NK'OKU YAAHANDIIKIRWE</para>
  <para style="mt1">YOHAANA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s1">Kigambo okuhinduka omuntu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1JN 1:1">1 Yoh 1:1</ref>, <ref loc="1JN 1:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:13">Kush 19:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwa mbere na mbere hakaba hariho Kigambo; Kigambo ogwo akaba atuura na Ruhanga; kandi Kigambo akaba ari Ruhanga. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 8:22">Enf 8:22</ref>. </char></note> Ogwo omu kutandika akaba ariho na Ruhanga; <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:16">Kol 1:16</ref>, <ref loc="COL 1:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 1:2">Heb 1:2</ref>. </char></note> ebintu byona niwe yaabihangire, kandi omu byahangirwe byona tihariho kintu na kimwe eki atarahangire. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:26">Yoh 5:26</ref>. </char></note> Amagara gakaba gari Omushana gw'abantu. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:19">Yoh 3:19</ref>. </char></note> Omushana ogwo gujwa omu mwirima, kandi omwirima tigukaguraazaga.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:1">Mat 3:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Hakaija omuntu owaatumirwe Ruhanga, orikwetwa Yohaana. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 3:3">Luk 3:3</ref>. </char></note> Ogwo akaija kuba kareebi ngu ahamye eby'omushana, abantu boona baikirize ahabwe. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />We akaba atari Mushana ogwo; kwonka akaija kuhamya eby'omushana. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Hakaba hariho Omushana ogw'amazima, ogujwera abantu boona, ogwabaire nigwija omu nsi. <verse eid="JHN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Akaba ari omu nsi, kandi ensi niwe yaagihangire, kwonka ensi teramumanyire. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Akaija owe, abaabaire bari abe tibaamwakiira; <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:26">Gal 3:26</ref>. </char></note> kwonka boona abaamwakiire, nibo abaikiriize eiziina rye, akabaha obushoboorozi okuba abaana ba Ruhanga. <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:5">Yoh 3:5</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 3:6">6</ref>. </char></note> Abo tibarazairwe shagama, n'obu kwakuba okukunda kw'omuntu; bakazaarwa Ruhanga. <verse eid="JHN 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 1:16">2 Pet 1:16</ref>, <ref loc="2PE 1:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 60:1">Isa 60:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:32">Luk 9:32</ref>. </char></note> Kigambo ogwo yaaba omuntu, yaatuura naitwe, twareeba ekitiinisa kye, ekitiinisa ky'eky'Omwana omwe nyamunegyere, owaarugire ahari Isheboona, aijwire embabazi n'amazima.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yohaana okuhamya Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mat 3:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yohaana yaamuhamya naagambira ahaiguru ati: Ogu niwe naagambireho nti: Orikwija enyima yangye niwe arikunkira, ahabw'okuba akaba ariho ntakabaireho. <verse eid="JHN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:19">Kol 1:19</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ebiri omuriwe byona nibyo twahairweho twena, n'embabazi ezongyererwa aha zindi. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Ahakuba Ebiragiro bikareetwa Musa; embabazi n'amazima byo byareetwa Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 4:12">1 Yoh 4:12</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 6:16">1 Tim 6:16</ref>. </char></note> Okuruga iranaira tihariho orareebire Ruhanga; Omwana we omwe nyamunegyere, ori omu kifuba kya Ishe, niwe yaamumanyiise.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abayudaaya okubuuza Yohaana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Oku nikwo kuhamya kwa Yohaana, obu Abayudaaya baamutumaho abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi abaarugire Yerusaalemu kumubuuza bati: Ori oha? <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Yaabagambira butunu, atarikwehakana, naahamya ati: Nyowe tindi Kristo. <verse eid="JHN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:10">Mat 17:10</ref>. </char></note> Baamubuuza bati: Mbwenu shi ori Eliya? Yaabagarukamu ati: Tindi we. Bati, Ori nabi ori? Yaabagarukamu ati: Ngaaha! <verse eid="JHN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Nikyo baamubuuriize bati: Iwe shi, ori oha, tubone kugarukamu abatutumire? Nooyegamba ota? <verse eid="JHN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Isa 40:3</ref>. </char></note> Yaagira ati: Ndi eiraka ery'orikugambira omu ihamba, naagira ati: Mugorore omuhanda gwa Mukama, nk'oku nabi Isaaya yaagambire. <verse eid="JHN 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Abaatumirwe abo bakaba batumirwe Abafarisaayo. <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />Baamubuuza bati: Ahabw'enki iwe noobatiza, ku oraabe otari Kristo, otari Eliya, nari shi nabi ori? <verse eid="JHN 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Yohaana yaabagarukamu ati: Nyowe mbatiza n'amaizi; kwonka omuriimwe heemereiremu ou mutarikumanya; <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:25">Byak 13:25</ref>. </char></note> niwe arikwija enyima yangye; tinshemereire kuyuzya orukoba rw'enkaito ze. <verse eid="JHN 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Ebyo bikabaho omuri Besania seeri ya Yorudani, ahu Yohaana yaabaire naabatiriza.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yohaana okweta Yesu “Omwana gw'entaama wa Ruhanga”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 53:7">Isa 53:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku bwaseesire, yaareeba Yesu naija ah'ari, yaagira ati: Reeba, Omwana gw'entaama wa Ruhanga, orikwihaho ekibi ky'ensi! <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Ogu niwe naagambireho nti: Enyima yangye nihaija omuntu orikunkira, ahabw'okuba akaba ariho ntakabaireho. <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Kandi nyowe ahabwangye tindamumanyire; kwonka nkaija nimbatiza n'amaizi, ngu abone kushuuruurirwa Abaisraeli. <verse eid="JHN 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:10">Mak 1:10</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Yohaana yaahamya naagira ati: Nkareeba Omwoyo naashuuma okuruga omu iguru nk'enkombe, yaamugumaho. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Nkaba ntamumanyire; kwonka Owantumire kubatiza n'amaizi, niwe yangambiire ati: Ou orireeba Omwoyo naashumaho, akamugumaho, Ogwo niwe abatiza n'Omwoyo Orikwera. <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Naanye naareeba, naahamya nti, Ogwo n'Omwana wa Ruhanga.<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okwetwa kwa Anderea na Simooni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Kandi ku bwaseesire, Yohaana akaba ayemereire n'abeegi be babiri, <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />yaareeba Yesu naagyenda, yaagira ati: Reeba, Omwana gw'entaama wa Ruhanga! <verse eid="JHN 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Abeegi abo bombi baamuhurira naagamba, baakuratira Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Yesu yaahinduka, yaareeba bamukaratiire, yaababuuza ati: Nimwenda ki? Baamugarukamu bati: Rabi, (amakuru gaakyo ngu, Mwegyesa,) nooraara hi? <verse eid="JHN 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Yaabagira ati: Mwije muhareebe. Baija, baareeba ahu yaabaire naaraara, baaguma nawe ekyo kiro, ahakuba eshaaha zikaba ziri nka ikumi. <verse eid="JHN 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat 4:18-22</ref>. </char></note> Omwe ahari abo abaahuriire Yohaana, bakakuratira Yesu, ni Anderea, murumuna wa Simooni Petero. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Yaabanza kusherura mukuru we Simooni, yaamugira ati: Tureebire Mesia, (amakuru gaakyo ngu <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kristo niwe Mesia, byombi nibimanyisa Owaashukirweho amajuta. </char></note>Kristo). <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:18">Mat 16:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:16">Mak 3:16</ref>. </char></note> Yaamureeta ahari Yesu. Yesu yaamureeba, yaagira ati: Ori Simooni mwene Yohaana; oryayetwa <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Keefa ni Aramaic, Petros ni Rugriika; byombi amakuru gaabyo ngu, eibaare. </char></note>Keefa amakuru gaaryo ngu, Petero.<verse eid="JHN 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okwetwa kwa Filipo na Nasanaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Ku bwaseesire, Yesu yaayenda kurugayo kuza Galilaaya. Yaareeba Filipo, yaamugira ati: Nkurata. <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Kandi Filipo ogwo akaba ari owa Besesaida, tauni y'ow'aba Anderea na Petero. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:45: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:18">Bir 18:18</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 53:2">Isa 53:2</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:23">Ezk 34:23</ref>. </char></note> Filipo yaasherura Nasanaeli, yaamugira ati: Tureebire ou Musa yaahandiikireho omu Biragiro, kandi akahandiikwaho na baanabi, Yesu owa Nazareesi, omwana wa Yosefu. <verse eid="JHN 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:41">Yoh 7:41</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 7:52">52</ref>. </char></note> Nasanaeli yaamubuuza ati: Noogira ngu omuri Nazareesi nihabaasa kurugamu ekintu kirungi? Filipo yaamugira ati: Ija, oreebe. <verse eid="JHN 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:47: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 32:2">Zab 32:2</ref>. </char></note> Yesu ku yaareebire Nasanaeli naija ah'ari, yaamugambaho ati: Reeba Omwisraeli kashushu, otaine buryarya! <verse eid="JHN 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Nasanaeli yaamugira ati: Wammanyisibwa ki? Yesu yaamugarukamu ati: Filipo atakakwetsire, obu waaba ori ahansi y'omutiini, naakureeba. <verse eid="JHN 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:49: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:69">Yoh 6:69</ref>. </char></note> Nasanaeli yaamugira ati: Rabi, ori Omwana wa Ruhanga! Ori Omugabe wa Israeli! <verse eid="JHN 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yesu yaamugarukamu ati: Ahabw'okukugambira nti, Naakureeba ahansi y'omutiini, nikyo waikiririza? Oryareeba ebikuru ebirikukira ebyo. <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:51: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:12">Kut 28:12</ref>. </char></note> Yesu yaagaruka yaamugira ati: Buzimazima ninkugambira nti: Muryareeba eiguru rikinguukire, baamaraika ba Ruhanga nibatemba, kandi nibashuuma aha Mwana w'omuntu.<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s1">Obugyenyi bw'omuri Kaana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Aha kiro kya kashatu hakabaho obugyenyi bw'okushwera omuri Kaana eya Galilaaya, na nyina wa Yesu akaba ariyo. <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Yesu nawe akeetwa aha bugyenyi n'abeegi be. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Bwanyima, viinyo ku yaahweire, nyina wa Yesu yaamugira ati: Tibaine viinyo. <verse eid="JHN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 19:26">Yoh 19:26</ref>. </char></note> Yesu yaamugira ati: Mukazi 'we, noofa ki naanye? Obunaku bwangye tibukahikire. <verse eid="JHN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Nyina yaagira abaheereza ati: Eki araabaragiire kyona, mukikore. <verse eid="JHN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Kandi hakaba hariho enyungu mpango mukaaga, ezibaizire omu mabaare, ezaabaire zihigikiirwe aho, zitairweho ahabw'okweyeza, nk'emigyenzo y'Abayudaaya oku eri; enyungu emwe ekaba ebamu enjoga ibiri nari ishatu. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Yesu yaabaragiira ati: Mwijuze enyungu amaizi. Baaziijuriza kimwe. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Yaabagira ati: Mbwenu mutahe, mutwarire omukuru w'obugyenyi. Baamutwarira. <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Omukuru w'obugyenyi, ku yaarorize aha maizi agaahinduka viinyo, atarikumanya i yaaruga, (kwonka abaheereza abaatahire amaizi bo nibakimanya) yaayeta kishwera, <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />yaamugira ati: Omuntu weena abanza kugabura viinyo enungi; bwanyima, abantu ku bahaaga, abaha viinyo etanuzire; kwonka iwe obiikire enungi okuhitsya hati. <verse eid="JHN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:40">Yoh 11:40</ref>. </char></note> Aka niko kamanyiso k'okubanza aku Yesu yaakozire; akakakorera omuri Kaana eya Galilaaya, naayoreka ekitiinisa kye; n'abeegi be baamwikiriza. <verse eid="JHN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Bwanyima y'ekyo, yaashuuma, yaaza Kaperenaumu na nyina n'abarumuna n'abeegi be; baamarayo ebiro bikye.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okushemeza hekalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Okuhingurwaho kw'Abayudaaya kukaba kuri haihi kuhika; Yesu yainamuka Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14-16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:12">Mat 21:12</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 21:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Mak 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45">Luk 19:45</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 19:46">46</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaataahire omuri hekalu, yaashangamu abarikutunda ente n'entaama n'enkombe, n'abarikuhingisa empiiha, bashutami nibazihingisa. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Yaakwata emigoye, yaagigira nk'orukoba, yaababinga boona omuri hekalu, n'entaama n'ente zaabo; yaashuka ahansi empiiha z'abarikuhingisa, yaajuumika n'emeeza zaabo; <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />n'abaabaire nibatunda enkombe yaabagira ati: Mwiheho ebi; enju ya Tata murekye kugigira enju y'abashuubuzi. <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:9">Zab 69:9</ref>. </char></note> Abeegi be baijuka ebyahandiikirwe ngu, Okusaasibwa enju yaawe kuryandya. <verse eid="JHN 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:23">Mat 21:23</ref>. </char></note> Abayudaaya baagarukamu, baamubuuza bati: Ebyo wabikozire; mbwenu ni kamanyiso ki aku waakutworeka? <verse eid="JHN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:61">Mat 26:61</ref>. </char></note> Yesu yaabagarukamu ati: Musheenye hekalu egi; naanye ndyagiimutsya omu biro bishatu. <verse eid="JHN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Abayudaaya baagira bati: Hekalu egi ekamara emyaka makumi ana na mukaaga neeyombekwa; mbwenu iwe oryagiimutsya omu biro bishatu? <verse eid="JHN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 6:19">1 Kor 6:19</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka We akaba naagamba ahari hekalu ey'omubiri gwe. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Bwanyima, ku yaazookire omu bafu, abeegi be baijuka ku yaagambire ekyo, baikiriza Ebyahandiikirwe, n'ekigambo eki Yesu yaagambire. <verse eid="JHN 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Kandi ku yaabaire ari Yerusaalemu omu biro by'obugyenyi bw'Okuhingurwaho, baingi baikiriza eiziina rye, ku baareebire obumanyiso obu yaakozire. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Kwonka Yesu tarabeesigire, ahakuba akaba naamanya abantu boona; <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />n'ahabw'ekyo tarenzire muntu weena kumumanyisa eby'abantu; ahakuba We akaba naamanya ebiri omu muntu.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s1">Nikodemu n'eby'okuzaarwa obwa kabiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 7:50">Yoh 7:50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:39">19:39</ref>. </char>
    </note> Hakaba hariho omuntu ow'omu Bafarisaayo, orikwetwa Nikodemu, omwe aha bategyeki b'Abayudaaya. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Omushaija ogwo akaija ahari Yesu nyekiro, yaamugira ati: Rabi, nitumanya ku ori omwegyesa owaarugire ahari Ruhanga; ahakuba tihariho muntu orikubaasa kukora obumanyiso obu orikukora, kureka Ruhanga yaaguma nawe. <verse eid="JHN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:3">Mat 18:3</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:23">1 Pet 1:23</ref>. </char></note> Yesu yaamugarukamu ati: Buzimazima ninkugambira nti: Omuntu, ku aba atazairwe bwa kabiri, tabaasa kureeba bukama bwa Ruhanga. <verse eid="JHN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nikodemu yaamubuuza ati: Omuntu naabaasa ata kuzaarwa yaakuzire? Naabaasa kugaruka omunda ya nyina, azaarwe? <verse eid="JHN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 36:25-27">Ezk 36:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:26">Efe 5:26</ref>. </char></note> Yesu yaagarukamu ati: Buzimazima ninkugambira nti: Omuntu, ku aba atazairwe maizi na Mwoyo, tabaasa kutaaha omu bukama bwa Ruhanga. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:13">Yoh 1:13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 51:5">Zab 51:5</ref>. </char></note> Ekizaarwa omubiri kiba omubiri, n'ekizaarwa Omwoyo kiba omwoyo. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Otatangaarira eki naakugambira nti: Mushemereire kuzaarwa obwa kabiri. <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 37:9">Ezk 37:9</ref>. </char></note> Omuyaga guhuuha nigugarura ei gurikwenda, iwe ohurira okuhuuha kwagwo, kwonka tomanya i gurikuruga, n'obu yaakuba ei gurikuza; n'ozairwe Omwoyo weena nikwo aba. <verse eid="JHN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Nikodemu yaamugarukamu ati: Ebyo nibibaasika bita? <verse eid="JHN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Yesu yaagarukamu, naagira ati: Ori omwegyesa w'Abaisraeli, kandi torikumanya bigambo ebyo? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:28">Yoh 8:28</ref>. </char></note> Buzimazima ninkugambira nti: Itwe tugamba eki turikumanya, tuhamya eki twareebire; kwonka imwe timwikiriza kuhamya kwaitu. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:67">Luk 22:67</ref>. </char></note> Obu mbagambira eby'ensi, mutabiikirize, muryaikiriza muta, naabagambira eby'omu iguru? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:9">Efe 4:9</ref>. </char></note> Tihariho oratembire omu iguru, kureka Ogwo owaashuumire okuruga omu iguru, niwe Mwana w'omuntu ori omu iguru.<verse eid="JHN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 21:8">Kub 21:8</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 21:9">9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi nk'oku Musa yaahanikire enjoka omu ihamba, nikwo n'Omwana w'omuntu ashemereire kuhanikwa, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />ngu omuntu weena orikumwikiriza aheebwe amagara agatahwaho. <verse eid="JHN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Ahakuba oku nikwo Ruhanga yaakunzire atyo ensi, akahayo Omwana we omwe nyamunegyere, ngu omuntu weena orikumwikiriza arekye kuhwerekyerera, kureka atungye amagara agatahwaho. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:47">Yoh 12:47</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 17:31">Byak 17:31</ref>. </char></note> Mumanye ngu Ruhanga taratumire Mwana we omu nsi kugicwera orubanja, kureka ngu ensi ejunwe ahabwe. <verse eid="JHN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:24">Yoh 5:24</ref>. </char></note> Orikumwikiriza, tarikucwerwa rubanja; kwonka otarikumwikiriza, aherize kurucwerwa, ahabw'okuba taikiriize iziina ry'Omwana wa Ruhanga omwe nyamunegyere. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />Kandi oru nirwo rubanja, omushana gwizire omu nsi, abantu baakunda omwirima okukira omushana; ahakuba emicwe yaabo ekaba eri mibi. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:13">Efe 5:13</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu weena okora ebibi ayanga omushana, kandi taija ha mushana, ngu emicwe ye erekye kuhanwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Kwonka okora eby'amazima aija aha mushana, ngu emicwe ye ereebekye butunu ku yaakoreirwe omuri Ruhanga.<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yohaana okugaruka kuhamya Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Bwanyima y'ebyo Yesu n'abeegi be baataaha omu ishaza rya Buyudaaya; yaagumayo nabo, naabatiza. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Kandi na Yohaana akaba naabatiriza Enoni haihi na Salimu, ahabw'okuba aho niho amaizi maingi gaabaire gari; abantu baingi baija, baabatizibwa. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Kandi obwo Yohaana akaba atakatairwe mu kihome. <verse eid="JHN 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Haabaho empaka ahagati y'abeegi ba Yohaana n'Omuyudaaya aha by'okweyeza. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:26-34">Yoh 1:26-34</ref>. </char></note> Baija ahari Yohaana, baamugira bati: Rabi, omushaija owaabaire ari hamwe naiwe seeri ya Yorudani, ou waabaire noohamya, reeba nawe naabatiza, abantu boona nibagyenda ah'ari. <verse eid="JHN 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Yohaana yaagarukamu naagira ati: Omuntu tabaasa kweha kintu kyona, kureka biri akihairwe okuruga omu iguru. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:2">Mak 1:2</ref>. </char></note> Imwe mwenka nimuhamya ku naagambire nti: Nyowe tindi Kristo, kwonka nkatumwa kumwebembera. <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:15">Mat 9:15</ref>. </char></note> Oine omugore niwe kishwera; omugambi w'obugyenyi, ku ayemerera aha rubaju rwa kishwera yaamuhurira, ashemererwa munonga ahabw'okuhurira eiraka rye; n'ahabw'ekyo okushemererwa kwangye oku kuhikire. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />We ashemereire kuguma naakura, naanye nkaguma ningaruka ahansi.<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />Orugire omu iguru naakira boona; ow'ensi aba ari ow'ensi, kandi agamba eby'ensi. Orugire omu iguru naakira boona; <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />eki yaareebire n'eki yaahuriire, nibyo ahamya; kwonka tihariho muntu oikiriza ebi ahamya. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Oikiriza eby'okuhamya kwe, aba ahamize eki, ngu Ruhanga n'Ow'amazima. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:33">Yoh 1:33</ref>. </char></note> Ou Ruhanga yaatumire agamba ebigambo bya Ruhanga; ahakuba Ruhanga ku aza kuha Omwoyo, tamurenga. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:20">Yoh 5:20</ref>. </char></note> Ishe akunda Omwana, kandi amurekuriire byona. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 5:12">1 Yoh 5:12</ref>. </char></note> Orikwikiriza Omwana aine amagara agatahwaho; kwonka otarikworobera Mwana, taribona magara; kureka ekiniga kya Ruhanga kiguma ahariwe.<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu n'Omusamariakazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Mukama waitu yaamanya ku Abafarisaayo bahuriire ngu naayegyesa kandi naabatiza abeegi baingi okukira Yohaana, <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:17">1 Kor 1:17</ref>. </char></note> (haza kunu Yesu We tarabatiize, kureka abeegi be nibo baabatiize.) <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Ahabw'ekyo yaaruga Buyudaaya, yaagaruka Galilaaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Yaahurira ashemereire kuraba Samaria. <verse eid="JHN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 48:22">Kut 48:22</ref>. </char></note> Atyo yaahika omuri tauni ya Samaria, erikwetwa Sukaara, haihi n'ekibanja eki Yakobo yaahaire omutabani Yosefu. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Kandi aho hakaba hariho eiziba rya Yakobo. Yesu ahabw'okuruhibwa orugyendo, yaashutama aha rubaju rw'eiziba; obwo eshaaha zikaba ziri nka mukaaga. <verse eid="JHN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Haija Omusamariakazi kutaha amaizi; Yesu yaamushaba ati: Mpa eky'okunywa. <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />Ahakuba abeegi be bakaba bagiire omuri tauni kugura eby'okurya. <verse eid="JHN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 9:53">Luk 9:53</ref>. </char></note> Omusamariakazi yaamubuuza ati: K'ori Omuyudaaya, kandi nyowe Omusamariakazi, noobasa ota kunshaba eky'okunywa? (Ahakuba Abayudaaya bakaba batakwatanisa n'Abasamaria.) <verse eid="JHN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Yesu yaamugarukamu ati: Kuri noomanya ekiconco kya Ruhanga, n'Ogu orikukushaba ati, Mpa eky'okunywa, naiwe okaamushabire, nawe akaakuhaire amaizi g'amagara. <verse eid="JHN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Omukazi yaamugira ati: Mukama wangye, toine ky'okutahisa, kandi n'eiziba ni riraingwa; mbwenu ago maizi g'amagara noogaiha hi? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Iwe nookira tatenkuriitwe Yakobo, owaatuhaire eiziba eri, eri yaabaire anywaho n'abaana be, akeesheraho n'amasyo ge? <verse eid="JHN 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Yesu yaamugarukamu ati: Omuntu weena orikunywa aha maizi aga, aryagaruka agire eiriho; <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:35">Yoh 6:35</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 7:37-39">Yoh 7:37-39</ref>. </char></note> kwonka weena orikunywa aha maizi agu ndimuha, tarigira iriho ebiro byona; ahakuba amaizi agu ndimuha garyahinduka enshuro y'amaizi, efumukye omuriwe, neereeta amagara agatahwaho. <verse eid="JHN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Omukazi yaamugira ati: Mukama wangye, mpa amaizi ago, ndekye kugira eiriho n'obu kwakuba okugaruka aha kutaha.<verse eid="JHN 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Yesu yaamugira ati: Irooko oyete baro, ogarukye aha. <verse eid="JHN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Omukazi yaamugarukamu ati: Tiinyine mushaija. Yesu yaamugira ati: Waagamba gye okugira ngu, toine mushaija; <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />ahabw'okuba okashwerwa abashaija bataano; n'ogwo ou oine hati ti baro; eki waagamba n'amazima. <verse eid="JHN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 9:17">Yoh 9:17</ref>. </char></note> Omukazi yaamugira ati: Mukama wangye, naayetegyereza ku ori nabi. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:5">Bir 12:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 122:1-9">Zab 122:1-9</ref>. </char></note> Baatatenkuriitwe bakaba baramiza aha rushozi oru, kwonka imwe nimugira ngu Yerusaalemu niyo abantu bashemereire kuramiza. <verse eid="JHN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Yesu yaamugira ati: Mukazi 'we, nyikiriza, obunaku nibwija kuhika, obu mutariramizamu Isheboona aha rushozi oru, n'obu haakuba omuri Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Imwe muramya eki mutarikumanya; itwe turamya eki turikumanya, ahakuba okujunwa kuruga omu Bayudaaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Kwonka obunaku nibwija, kandi bwahikire, obu abaramya ab'amazima bariramizamu Isheboona omu mwoyo n'omu mazima; ahakuba Isheboona asherura abari nk'abo kumuramya. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Ruhanga n'Omwoyo; kandi abamuramya bashemereire kumuramiza omu Mwoyo n'omu mazima. <verse eid="JHN 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Omukazi yaamugira ati: Nimmanya ngu Mesia orikwetwa Kristo aryaija; ku ariija, aryatushobororera byona. <verse eid="JHN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 9:37">Yoh 9:37</ref>. </char></note> Yesu yaamugira ati: Manya, niinye orikugamba naiwe.<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Omu mwanya ogwo abeegi be baija; baatangaara ahabw'okuba yaaba naagaaniira n'omukazi; kwonka tihaine waamubuurize ati: Nooyenda ki? Nari shi, ati: Ahabw'enki noogaaniira nawe? <verse eid="JHN 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Atyo omukazi yaatsiga aho enyungu ye, yaagaruka omuri tauni, yaagambira abantu ati: <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />Mwije mureebe omuntu owangambira ebi naakozire byona. Yaaba niwe Kristo? Shinta. <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Baaruga omuri tauni, nibaza ei ari.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Ku baabaire batakamuhikire, abeegi be baamweshengyereza bati: Rabi, eby'okurya mbibi, ryaho. <verse eid="JHN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Yaabagira ati: Nyine eby'okurya ebi mutarikumanya. <verse eid="JHN 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Abeegi be nikwo kubuuzana bati: Beitu shi, hariho owaamureetera eby'okurya? <verse eid="JHN 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Yesu yaabagira ati: Eby'okurya byangye nikwo kukora eki Owantumire akunda n'okuhikiiriza omurimo gwe. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:37">Mat 9:37</ref>. </char></note> Imwe timurikugira ngu, hatsigaire ameezi ana okuhika aha igyesha? Nyowe nimbagambira nti: Munagye amaisho, mureebe emisiri ku eyezire, ku ehikire kugyeshwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Omugyesi aheebwa ebihembo, ashanguririza emyaka omu magara agatahwaho, ngu omubibi n'omugyesi bashemererwe hamwe. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Ahakuba omuri ebi ekigambo eki nimwo kimanyirwa ku kiri eky'amazima, ngu: Habiba omwe, hagyesha ondiijo. <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Nkabatuma kugyesha ebi mutarahendekyeire; abandi bakahendeka n'emirimo, imwe mwaija, mwahikira omu bi baafeereire kubi.<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Abasamaria baingi ab'omuri tauni egyo baamwikiriza ahabw'ebigambo by'omukazi ebi yaagambire naahamya ati: Yangambira ebi naakozire byona. <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />N'ahabw'ekyo Abasamaria, ku baamuhikire, baamushaba ngu agume nabo; nawe nikwo kumarayo kabiri. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Haikiriza abandi baingi abarikukira ab'okubanza, ahabw'ekigambo kye. <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 4:14">1 Yoh 4:14</ref>. </char></note> Baagambira omukazi bati: Mbwenu titurikwikiriza habw'ebigambo byawe byonka; ahakuba naitwe twayehuririra, twamanya ngu Ogu niwe Mujuni w'ensi buzima.<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Ebyo biro bibiri ku byahweire, yaarugayo, yaaza Galilaaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />Ahakuba Yesu akahamya ati: Nabi tagira kitiinisa omu nsi y'owaabo. <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:45: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:23">Yoh 2:23</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaahikire Galilaaya, Abanyagalilaaya baamwakiira, ahabw'okuba bakareeba byona ebi yaakoreire Yerusaalemu aha bugyenyi; ahakuba nabo bakaba babutaahire.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okukiza mutabani w'omukungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Kandi yaagaruka, yaataaha Kaana eya Galilaaya, ahu yaahinduriire amaizi viinyo. Omuri Kaperenaumu hakaba harimu omukungu w'omugabe, owaabaire arwarize omutabani. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Ku yaahuriire ngu Yesu arugire Buyudaaya, yaaza Galilaaya, yaagyenda yaamushaba ngu ashuume akize omutabani, ahakuba akaba ari haihi kufa. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:48: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:22">1 Kor 1:22</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'ekyo Yesu yaamugira ati: Ku muba mutareebire bumanyiso n'eby'okutangaaza, timwikiriza na kakye. <verse eid="JHN 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Omukungu yaamushaba ati: Mukama wangye, shuuma oije, omwana wangye atakafiire. <verse eid="JHN 4:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Yesu yaamugira ati: Irooko otaahe; omwana waawe ahuriire. Omushaija ogwo yaikiriza ekigambo eki Yesu yaamugambira, yaagyenda. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Ku yaabaire naashuuma, abahuuku be baamubugana, baamugira bati: Omwana waawe ahuriire. <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Yaababuuza eshaaha ei atandikiireho kubaho gye, baamugarukamu bati: Nyomwabazyo aha shaaha ya mushanju omushwija nibwo gumurugireho. <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:53: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:31">Byak 16:31</ref>. </char></note> Ishe yaamanya ku nibwo bunaku obu Yesu amugambiriiremu ati: Omwana waawe ahuriire. Omushaija ogwo yaikiriza n'eka ye yoona. <verse eid="JHN 4:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Ako niko kamanyiso ka kabiri aku Yesu yaakozire, okwiha obu yaaruga Buyudaaya, naija Galilaaya.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu okukiza ekimuga kya Beseseda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Bwanyima y'ebyo hakaba hariho obugyenyi bw'Abayudaaya; Yesu yainamuka Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Kandi omuri Yerusaalemu haihi n'eirembo ry'entaama, hakaba hariho ekiyanja, ekirikwetwa omu Ruheburaayo Beseseda, kiriho ebiju bitaano. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Omwo nimwo baabaire bata abarwaire baingi munonga, empumi, abarema, n'abazingazingirwe, nibategyereza amaizi kubira; <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />ahakuba obundi n'obundi maraika akaba ashuuma aija omu kiyanja, abiza amaizi; owaabaire atangamu abandi, amaizi gaatandika kubira, akaba akira endwara yoona ei yaabaire aba arwaire. <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Aho hakaba hariho omushaija owaabaire amazire emyaka makumi ashatu na munaana arwaire. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Yesu ku yaamureebire abyami, kandi yaamanya ngu amazire aho omwanya muhango, yaamubuuza ati: Nooyenda kukira? <verse eid="JHN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Omurwaire yaamugarukamu ati: Mukama wangye, tingira muntu w'okunta omu kiyanja, amaizi gaaba nigatandika kubira; nyowe ku mba ninkiija, ondiijo antangamu. <verse eid="JHN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:6">Mat 9:6</ref>. </char></note> Yesu yaamuragiira ati: Imuka, oyekorere ekirago kyawe, ogyende. <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Ahonaaho omushaija yaakira, yaagyenda. Kandi eizooba eryo ekaba eri Sabato.<verse eid="JHN 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Abayudaaya baagambira owaatambirwa bati: Hati ni Sabato; ebiragiro tibirikukwikiriza kwekorera kirago kyawe. <verse eid="JHN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Yaabagarukamu ati: Omushaija owantambira niwe yandagiira ati: Yekorera ekirago kyawe, ogyende. <verse eid="JHN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Baamubuuza bati: Ogwo mushaija n'oha owaakuragiira ati: Yekorere ekirago kyawe, ogyende? <verse eid="JHN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Kwonka owaatambiirwe tiyaamumanya, ahakuba Yesu akaba yaarugireho ahabw'omutwe muhango ogwabaire guriho. <verse eid="JHN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:11">Yoh 8:11</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Yesu yaamushanga omuri hekalu, yaamugira ati: Reeba, waakira; otarigaruka kushiisha, nyentsya otarihikwaho akabi akarikukira ako. <verse eid="JHN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Omushaija yaagyenda, yaagambira Abayudaaya, ku Yesu niwe amukirize. <verse eid="JHN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:14">Mat 12:14</ref>. </char></note> Ekyo nikyo Abayudaaya baahiigiire Yesu, ahabw'okuba akakora ebyo ahari Sabato. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Yesu yaabagarukamu ati: Tata naakikora na hati, kandi naanye ninkora. <verse eid="JHN 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:33">Yoh 10:33</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo kyakizire kureetera Abayudaaya kusherura oburyo bw'okumwita, ti habw'okushiisha Sabato yonka, kureka n'ahabw'okugira ati: Ruhanga ni Tata, akeeringanisa na Ruhanga.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahu obushoboorozi bwa Yesu buruga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Yesu yaagarukamu naabagira ati: Buzimazima nimbagambira nti: Omwana tabaasa kukora kintu kyona ahabwe, kureka eki areeba Ishe naakora; mumanye ngu ebi Ruhanga akora byona, n'Omwana nawe nibyo akora; <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:35">Yoh 3:35</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba Ishe akunda Omwana, kandi amworeka ebi akora byona; kandi aryamworeka ebirikukira ebi, ngu imwe mutangaare. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Nk'oku Isheboona azoora abafu, akabaha amagara, nikwo n'Omwana aha amagara abu ayenda kugaha. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:31">Byak 17:31</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba na Ishe tacwera muntu weena orubanja, okucwa orubanja kwona akakurekurira Omwana, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:10">Fil 2:10</ref>, <ref loc="PHP 2:11">11</ref>. </char></note> ngu boona bahe Omwana ekitiinisa, nk'oku bakiha Ishe. Otaha Mwana kitiinisa, takiha na Ishe owaamutumire. <verse eid="JHN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:16">Yoh 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:51">8:51</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:14">1 Yoh 3:14</ref>. </char></note> Buzimazima nimbagambira nti: Orikuhurira ekigambo kyangye, akaikiriza Owantumire, aine amagara agatahwaho, kandi tariza mu rubanja; ahabw'okuba aherize kuruga omu kufa, yaataaha omu magara.<verse eid="JHN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Buzimazima nimbagambira nti: Obunaku nibwija, kandi buriho na hati mbwenu, abafu obu barihurira eiraka ry'Omwana wa Ruhanga; n'abo abaririhurira baryaba abahuriire. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Ahakuba nk'oku Ishe aine amagara omuriwe wenka, nikwo yaahaire n'Omwana kugagira omuriwe wenka; <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />kandi akamuha obushoboorozi bw'okucwa emanja, ahabw'okuba niwe Mwana w'omuntu. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Mutatangaarira eki; ahakuba obunaku nibwija, abari omu bituuro boona obu barihurira eiraka rye, <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />bakarugamu, abo abaakozire gye, bakazookyera amagara; nabo abaakozire kubi, bakazookyera okucwerwa orubanja. <verse eid="JHN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:38">Yoh 6:38</ref>. </char></note> Tindikubaasa kukora kintu kyona ahabwangye; oku mpurira, nikwo ncwa orubanja; n'emanja ezi ncwa, nzicwa omu mazima, ahabw'okuba tiinyenda kutwaza nk'oku ndikwenda ahabwangye, kureka nk'Owantumire oku arikwenda.<verse eid="JHN 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebirikuhamya Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />Ku ndikwehamya nyenka, okwehamya kwangye nikuba kutari kw'amazima; <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:36">Yoh 5:36</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 5:37">37</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 5:9">1 Yoh 5:9</ref>. </char></note> hariho ondiijo orikumpamya, kandi nimmanya ngu okuhamya oku ampamya n'okw'amazima. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Imwe mukatuma ahari Yohaana, nawe yaabahamiza amazima. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Okuhamibwa, oku ndikwegamira, tikurikuruga ha muntu; kwonka ebi nimbigamba, ngu imwe mujunwe. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Yohaana ogwo akaba ari etabaaza erikwaka, ekamurika; naimwe mukamara akaanya kakye nimwikiriza kushemerererwa okumurika kwe. <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Kwonka nyowe nyine ebirikumpamya ebikuru ebirikukira ebya Yohaana; ahakuba emirimo ei Tata yampaire kuhikiiriza, emirimo egyo ei ndikukora niyo erikumpamya ku Tata yantumire. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Kandi Tata owantumire niwe ampamize. Imwe timukahuriraga iraka rye, n'obu kwakuba okureeba enshusha ye; <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />kandi ekigambo kye tikituura muriimwe; ahabw'okuba timwikiriza u yaatumire.<verse eid="JHN 5:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:39: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2TI 3:15-17">2 Tim 3:15-17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Musherura munonga omu Byahandiikirwe, ahakuba muteekateeka ngu omuribyo nimwo mwine amagara agatahwaho; haza kandi ebyo nibyo bimpamya. <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Kwonka mwanga kwija ahariinye, ngu muheebwe amagara. <verse eid="JHN 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />Tindikwikiriza kitiinisa eki ndikuheebwa abantu. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />Ahakuba nimmanya imwe ku mutarikukunda Ruhanga omu mitima yaanyu. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Nyizire omu iziina rya Tata, timwanyakiira; ondiijo ku ariija omu iziina rye wenka, we muryamwakiira. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:43">Yoh 12:43</ref>. </char></note> Nimubaasa muta kwikiriza, imwe abahaana ekitiinisa, haza mutasherura kitiinisa ekiruga ahari Ruhanga omwe wenka? <verse eid="JHN 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:45: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:26">Bir 31:26</ref>. </char></note> Murekye kugira ngu niinye ndibarega ahari Tata; hariho omwe obarega, niwe Musa, ou mwesiga. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Bir 18:15</ref>. </char></note> Kuri mwaikiriize Musa, naanye mukaanyikiriize, ahakuba niinye yaahandiikireho. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:47: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:19">Yoh 7:19</ref>. </char></note> Ku muraabe mutaikiriza bi yaahandiikire, muryabaasa muta kwikiriza ebigambo byangye?<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu okuriisa abantu 5,000</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1-15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">15:32-39</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:32-44">Mak 6:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">8:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9:10-17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima y'ebyo Yesu yaarugayo, yaayambuka seeri y'enyanja ya Galilaaya, niyo nyanja ya Tiberia. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Omutwe muhango gw'abantu gwamukuratira, ahakuba bakareeba obumanyiso obu yaakozire aha barwaire. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Yesu yaatemba omu bibungo, yaashutamayo n'abeegi be. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Kandi obugyenyi bw'Abayudaaya obw'Okuhingurwaho bukaba buri haihi. <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Yesu ku yaanagire amaisho, yaareeba omutwe gw'abantu baingi nigwija ah'ari, yaabuuza Filipo ati: Nitwija kugura hi emigaati, ei aba bantu baraarye? <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Akamubuuza atyo kumugyeza, ahakuba We akaba naamanya eki araakore. <verse eid="JHN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Filipo yaamugarukamu ati: Emigaati erikugurwa edenaari magana abiri terikubahika, n'obu omuntu weena yaakuryaho kakye. <verse eid="JHN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Omwe aha beegi be, Anderea murumuna wa Simooni Petero, yaamugira ati: <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />Aha hariho omwojo oine emigaati ya sayiri etaano n'eby'enyanja bibiri; kwonka ebyo nibigasira ki abantu abarikwinga bati? <verse eid="JHN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Yesu yaagira ati: Mushutamye abantu. Kandi aho hakaba hariho akacwamba kahango; abantu baashutama ahansi, bakaba bari nk'enkumi itaano. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Atyo Yesu yaayakiira egyo migaati; ku yaaherize kusiima, yaagigaburira abantu abaabaire bashutami; yaabaha n'eby'enyanja, nk'oku baayenzire. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Ku baahaagire, yaaragiira abeegi be ati: Mutorotoore oburagarika obwatsigaraho, hatagira akaaburaho. <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Baabutorotoora, baijuza ebitenga ikumi na bibiri oburagarika obwashaagire aha migaati etaano ya sayiri, ei baariire. <verse eid="JHN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Abantu ku baareebire akamanyiso aku yaakora, baagira bati: Buzima ogu niwe nabi ogwo orikwenda kwija omu nsi! <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 18:36">Yoh 18:36</ref>. </char></note> Yesu, ku yaayetegyereize ngu nibenda kwija kumukwatsa amaani ngu bamugire omugabe, yaabarugamu mpora, yaagaruka omu bibungo wenka.<verse eid="JHN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okugyendesa amaguru aha nyanja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:16-21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mat 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mak 6:45-52</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku bwabaire omu mwabazyo, abeegi be baashuuma aha nyanja, <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />baaragara omu bwato, baatandika kwambuka egyo nyanja, bagyemire Kaperenaumu. Bukaba bwaizire, kandi na Yesu akaba atakabahikire. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Enyanja yaahinduriza ahabw'omuyaga mwingi ogwabaire niguhuuha. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Ku baavugireho nka <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Omu Rugriika: ni sitadiyo 25 nari 30. </char></note>mahiro ishatu nari ina, baareeba Yesu naagyendera aha nyanja nairirira obwato, baatiina. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />We yaabahuumuriza naagira ati: Niinye; mutatiina. <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />N'ahabw'ekyo baikiriza obwato bwahika aha nkungu, ahu baabaire nibaza.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Ku bwaseesire, abantu abaabaire batsigaire seeri y'enyanja, baijuka ku haabaire hariho obwato bumwe bwonka, kandi Yesu ku atabugyenziremu n'abeegi be, kureka ku baagyenzire bonka. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Agandi maato gaija nigaruga Tiberia, gaahika haihi n'omwanya, ahu baariiriire emigaati ei Mukama waitu Yesu yaasiimiire. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Batyo abantu abo, ku baareebire ngu Yesu tariyo, n'obu baakuba abeegi be, bo baaragara omu maato ago, baaza Kaperenaumu, nibamusherura.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu omugaati gw'amagara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Ku baamushangire seeri y'enyanja, baamubuuza bati: Rabi, aha oizireho ryari? <verse eid="JHN 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Yesu yaabagarukamu ati: Buzimazima nimbagambira nti: Timurikunsherura ahabw'okuba mureebire obumanyiso, kureka ahabw'okuba muriire emigaati, mwaiguta. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Mutarihendekyera eby'okurya ebirikuhwaho, kureka eby'okurya ebirikugumaho okuhitsya aha magara agatahwaho, agu Omwana w'omuntu aribaha; ahakuba Ruhanga Ishe akamutaho akamanyiso. <verse eid="JHN 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Baamubuuza bati: Tushemereire kukora ki, tukabona kukora emirimo ya Ruhanga? <verse eid="JHN 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 3:23">1 Yoh 3:23</ref>. </char></note> Yesu yaabagarukamu ati: ogu nigwo murimo gwa Ruhanga, imwe okwikiriza Ogwo ou yaatumire. <verse eid="JHN 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />N'ahabw'ekyo baamubuuza bati: Mbwenu nookora kamanyiso ki, aku twakureeba, tukakwikiriza? Okora ki? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:13">Kur 16:13</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 16:14">14</ref>. </char></note> Baatatenkuriitwe bakarya emaanu omu ihamba; nk'oku kyahandiikirwe ngu, Akabaha omugaati ogwarugire omu iguru. <verse eid="JHN 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Yesu nikwo kubagira ati: Buzimazima nimbagambira nti: Musa tiwe yaabahaire omugaati ogwarugire omu iguru; kureka Tata niwe abaha omugaati gw'amazima oguruga omu iguru. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:51">Yoh 6:51</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba omugaati gwa Ruhanga nigwo gushuuma niguruga omu iguru, gukaha ensi amagara. <verse eid="JHN 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Baamushaba bati: Mukama waitu ogume otuhe ogwo mugaati obutoosha.<verse eid="JHN 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 4:14">Yoh 4:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 7:37">7:37</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yesu yaabagira ati: Niinye mugaati gw'amagara; orikwija ahariinye, tarigira njara; n'orikuunyikiriza, tarikwatwa iriho na kakye. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Kwonka nkabagambira nti: Mundeebire, kunu timwanyikiriza. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:28">Mat 11:28</ref>. </char></note> Abu Tata ampa boona baryaija ahariinye; orikwija ahariinye tindimubinga na kakye. <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Ahakuba tindarugire mu iguru kukora ebi ndikweyendera, kureka okukora ebi Owantumire akunda; <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:28">Yoh 10:28</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 10:29">29</ref>. </char></note> kandi eki nikyo Owantumire akunda, ngu ahari boona abu yampaire, harekye kuburaho n'omwe, kureka mbazoore aha kiro ky'aha mperu. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Eki Tata akunda n'eki, ngu weena orikureeba Omwana, akamwikiriza, atungye amagara agatahwaho; naanye ndyamuzoora aha kiro ky'aha mperu.<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Ekyo nikyo kyareeteire Abayudaaya kumwetomboitera, ahabw'okuba akagira ati: Niinye mugaati ogwarugire omu iguru. <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Baagira bati: Ogu tiwe Yesu mwene Yosefu, ou turikumanya ishe na nyina? Mbwenu naabaasa ata kugira ngu akaruga omu iguru? <verse eid="JHN 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Yesu yaabagarukamu ati: Muteetomboita mwenka. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Tihariho orikubaasa kwija ahariinye, Tata owantumire yaaba atamwiriize haihi; naanye ndyamuzoora aha kiro ky'aha mperu. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:45: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:33">Yer 31:33</ref>, <ref loc="JER 31:34">34</ref>. </char></note> Kikahandiikwa omu bya Baanabi ngu, Boona baryayegyesibwa Ruhanga. Omuntu weena ohurira ebya Tata, akabyega, aija ahariinye. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Mutagira ngu hariho orareebire Tata, kureka Ogwo owaarugire ahari Ruhanga; niwe yaamureebire. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Buzimazima nimbagambira nti: Orikwikiriza aine amagara agatahwaho. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Niinye mugaati gw'amagara. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:49: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:3">1 Kor 10:3</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 10:5">5</ref>. </char></note> Bashwenkuriimwe bakarya emaanu omu ihamba, baafa. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Ogu nigwo mugaati oguruga omu iguru buzima ogu omuntu aryaho, atafe. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Niinye mugaati gw'amagara ogwarugire omu iguru; omuntu weena ku arikurya aha mugaati ogu, naagumaho ebiro byona; kandi omugaati, ogu ndiha ahabw'ab'omu nsi ngu batungye amagara, n'omubiri gwangye. <verse eid="JHN 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />N'ahabw'ekyo Abayudaaya baahakana bonka nibagira bati: Omushaija ogu naabaasa ata kutuha omubiri gwe kugurya? <verse eid="JHN 6:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Yesu yaabagira ati: Buzimazima nimbagambira nti: Ku murikuba mutariire mubiri gw'Omwana w'omuntu, kandi mutanyweire shagama ye, timurikugira magara omuriimwe. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Orikurya omubiri gwangye akanywa eshagama yangye, aine amagara agatahwaho, kandi ndyamuzoora aha kiro ky'aha mperu; <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />ahakuba omubiri gwangye n'eky'okurya eky'amazima, kandi n'eshagama yangye n'eky'okunywa eky'amazima. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:56: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:4">Yoh 15:4</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:24">1 Yoh 3:24</ref>. </char></note> Orya omubiri gwangye, akanywa eshagama yangye, aguma omuriinye, naanye omuriwe. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Nka Tata ohuriire oku yantumire, naanye nk'oku ndi ohuriire ahabwa Tata, nikwo n'orikundya ariba ohuriire ahabwangye. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Ogu nigwo mugaati ogwarugire omu iguru, ti nk'ogu bashwenkuriimwe baariire bakafa; orikurya omugaati ogu aryagumaho ebiro byona. <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Ebigambo ebyo akabigambira omuri <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:59 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">sinagogi n'ekanisa y'ekiyudaaya. </char></note>sinagogi, naayegyesa omuri Kaperenaumu.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okugaruka enyima kw'abeegi be baingi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Baingi aha beegi be, ku baahuriire ekyo, baagira bati: Ekigambo eki nikiremeera; n'oha orikukibaasa? <verse eid="JHN 6:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Yesu, ku yaamanyire ngu abeegi be bakyetomboitera, yaababuuza ati: Ekyo nikyo kyabaremesa? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Mbwenu shi, kiryaba kita, ku murireeba Omwana w'omuntu naatemba ei yaabaire ari bwambere? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:63: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 3:6">2 Kor 3:6</ref>. </char></note> Omwoyo niwe aha amagara; omubiri tigwine mugasho; ebigambo ebi naabagambira n'omwoyo n'amagara. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Kwonka omuriimwe harimu abatarikwikiriza. Ahakuba Yesu akaba naamanya okuruga karenakare abatarikumwikiriza, n'ogwo owaabaire naayenda kumureebya oku ari. <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Yaagira ati: Nikyo naabagambirira nti: Tihariho orikubaasa kwija ahariinye kureka biri yaakiheebwa Tata.<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Okuruga aho baingi aha beegi be baagaruka enyima, tibaagumizamu kugyenda nawe. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Yesu nikwo kubuuza bari ikumi na babiri ati: Naimwe nimwenda kwegyendera? <verse eid="JHN 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Simooni Petero yaamugarukamu ati: Mukama waitu, nituza ahari oha? Ka niiwe oine ebigambo by'amagara agatahwaho; <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:69: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:27">Yoh 11:27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 14:33">Mat 14:33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:16">16:16</ref>. </char></note> naitwe tukaikiriza, twamanya ngu ori Orikwera wa Ruhanga. <verse eid="JHN 6:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Yesu yaabagarukamu ati: Tiinye naabatooraine imwe ikumi na babiri? Kwonka omwe omuriimwe ni sitaane. <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Ekyo akakigamba ahari Yuda mwene Simooni Iskaryota, owaabaire naayenda kumureebya, omwe ahari ikumi na babiri.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu okwangwa beene waabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 9:30">Mak 9:30</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima y'ebyo akagyendagyenda omuri Galilaaya; tiyaayenda kugyendagyenda omuri Buyudaaya, ahabw'okuba Abayudaaya bakaba nibenda kumwita. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:34">Lev 23:34</ref>. </char></note> Kandi obugyenyi bw'Abayudaaya, oburikwetwa obugyenyi bw'Ensiisira, bukaba buri haihi n'okuhika. <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Abarumuna baamugira bati: Ruga aha, oze Buyudaaya, abeegi baawe babone kureeba emirimo ei orikukora. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Ahakuba tihariho muntu oyenda kumanywa butunu, akakora omu mubonano. Ku oraabe nookora ebi, oyeyorekye ensi. <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />Ahakuba n'abarumuna abo tibaramwikiriize. <verse eid="JHN 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Yesu yaabagambira ati: obunaku bwangye tibukahikire; kwonka obwanyu n'obw'obutoosha. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:18">Yoh 15:18</ref>. </char></note> Ensi terikubaasa kubanga, kwonka nyowe neenyanga, ahabw'okuba nimpamya ku emirimo yaayo eri mibi. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Imwe mwinamukye aha bugyenyi; nyowe tinkabaire kuza ahari obwo bugyenyi, ahakuba obunaku bwangye tibukahikire. <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Ku yaaherize kubagambira ebyo, yaaguma Galilaaya.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Abarumuna ku baaherize kwinamuka aha bugyenyi, nawe yainamuka, kwonka tiyaagyenda naareebwa, kureka yaagyenda bwesherekye. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Abayudaaya baamusherura aha bugyenyi, nibabuuririza bati: Ari nkahi? <verse eid="JHN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Haabaho okumuhakanaho munonga omu bantu: abamwe nibagira bati: N'omushaija murungi; abandi bati: Ngaaha, naahabisa abantu. <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:42">Yoh 12:42</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ahabw'okutiina Abayudaaya tihariho n'omwe owaamugambireho butunu.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okwegyesa omuri hekalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Obugyenyi ku bwahikire ahagati, Yesu yainamuka omuri hekalu, yaayegyesa. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:54">Mat 13:54</ref>. </char></note> Abayudaaya baatangaara, nibagira bati: omushaija ogu akaiha hi obwengye obu, haza atakeegaga? <verse eid="JHN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />N'ahabw'ekyo Yesu yaabagarukamu ati: Okwegyesa oku nyegyesa ti kwangye, n'okw'Ogwo owantumire. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Omuntu weena, ku ayenda kukora ebi Ogwo akunda, niwe arimanya yaaba okwegyesa okwo kuruga ahari Ruhanga, nari shi ku nyegambira ahabwangye. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Orikwegambira ahabwe, naaba naayesherurira ekitiinisa; kwonka orikusherurira Owaamutumire ekitiinisa, niwe w'amazima, kandi omuriwe tiharimu kutahikiirira kwona. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:16">Yoh 5:16</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 5:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:53">Byak 7:53</ref>. </char></note> Musa tarabahaire Ebiragiro? Kwonka omuriimwe tihariho ohitsya Ebiragiro. Nimwendera ki kuunyita? <verse eid="JHN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:48">Yoh 8:48</ref>. </char></note> Abantu baamugarukamu bati: oriho daimoni. N'oha orikwenda kukwita? <verse eid="JHN 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Yesu yaabagarukamu ati: Nkakora ekintu kimwe, mwena mwakitangaarira. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:10-12">Kut 17:10-12</ref>. </char></note> Musa akabateeraho omugyenzo gw'okushara; (kwonka tikurarugire hari Musa, kureka ahari baashwenkuriimwe,) kandi mushara omuntu ahari Sabato. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Mbwenu shi, omuntu ku araabe asharwa ahari Sabato, ngu ekiragiro kya Musa kitahendwa, nimungwererwa ki kubi ahabw'okukiriza kimwe omuntu ahari Sabato? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Mutaricwa emanja nimwiha aha mireebekyere y'omuntu, mugume mucwe emanja z'oburyo.<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abafarisaayo okutuma ab'okukwata Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Kandi bamwe aha ba Yerusaalemu baagira bati: Omushaija ou barikusherura kwita tiwe ogu? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Mbwenu ari aha, naagamba butunu, kandi tibaine ku baamugira! Ebyo, abakuru nibamanya buzima ku Ogu ari Kristo? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Itwe nitumanya omushaija ogu ei arikuruga; kwonka Kristo we ku ariija, tihariho n'omwe orimanya ahi arikuruga. <verse eid="JHN 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Nikyo Yesu yaagambiire n'eiraka rihango naayegyesa omuri hekalu ati: Nyowe nimummanya, kandi nimumanya n'ei naarugire. Tindaizire habwangye; Owantumire n'ow'amazima, kwonka We timurikumumanya. <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:27">Mat 11:27</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka nyowe nimmumanya, ahabw'okuba nkaruga ah'ari, kandi niwe yantumire. <verse eid="JHN 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:1">Yoh 13:1</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo baayenda kumukwata; kwonka tihariho n'omwe owaamutaireho emikono, ahakuba obunaku bwe bukaba butakahikire. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:30">Yoh 8:30</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:42">Yoh 12:42</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka bantu baingi baamwikiriza, nibagira bati: Kristo ku ariija, aryakora obumanyiso bwingi okukira obu omushaija ogu akozire?<verse eid="JHN 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Abafarisaayo baahurira abantu nibamugambaho mpora batyo; abanyamurwa abakuru n'Abafarisaayo nikwo kutuma abakuru b'abaserukare kumukwata. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:33">Yoh 13:33</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo Yesu yaagiriire ati: Hatsigaire omwanya mukye, nyowe nkiri hamwe naimwe; bwanyima ngarukye ahari Ogwo owantumire; <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:21">Yoh 8:21</ref>. </char></note> muryansherura, timurimbona; kandi ei ndi, timurikubaasa kwijayo. <verse eid="JHN 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Abayudaaya baabuuzana bati: Omushaija ogu naayenda kuza hi, ei tutarimubona? Naayenda kuza omu baataataaniire omu Bagriika, ayegyese n'Abagriika? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Eki eki yaagamba n'enki, ati: Muryansherura, timurimbona, kandi ati: Ei ndi, timurikubaasa kwijayo?<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Emigyera y'amaizi g'amagara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:37: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 4:10">Yoh 4:10</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 4:14">14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aha izooba ry'aha muheru ery'ekiro kikuru ky'obugyenyi, Yesu yaayemerera, yaagamba n'eiraka rihango ati: Omuntu weena, ku araagire eiriho, aije ahariinye, anywe. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 44:3">Isa 44:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 55:1">55:1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 58:11">58:11</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:18">Yoel 3:18</ref>. </char></note> Orikuunyikiriza, emigyera y'amaizi g'amagara eryahimintuka omunda ye, nk'oku Ebyahandiikirwe bigamba. <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 3:17">2 Kor 3:17</ref>. </char></note> Ekyo akaba naakigamba aha Mwoyo, ou abarikumwikiriza bariija kuheebwa; ahakuba Omwoyo akaba atakahairwe, ahabw'okuba Yesu akaba atakahimbisiibwe.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:40: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 6:14">Yoh 6:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abantu bamwe, ku baahuriire ebigambo ebyo, baagira bati: Buzima ogu ni nabi ori. <verse eid="JHN 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Abandi baagira bati: Ogu ni Kristo. Kwonka abandi bati: Hoona Kristo n'ow'okuruga omuri Galilaaya? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 5:2">Mik 5:2</ref>. </char></note> Timurikumanya ku Ebyahandiikirwe bihamya ngu Kristo aryakomooka omu ruganda rwa Daudi, omu Betelehemu, ekirorero eki Daudi yaabaire atwiremu? <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Okwo abantu nikwo baamuhakaineho batyo. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Abamwe aharibo bakenda kumukwata; kwonka tihaine waamutaireho engaro.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nikodemu okutonganira Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Abakuru b'abaserukare baagaruka aha banyamurwa abakuru n'Abafarisaayo; bo baababuuza bati: Ahanki mutaamureeta? <verse eid="JHN 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Abakuru b'abaserukare baagarukamu bati: Tihakabahoga muntu orikugamba nk'ogu mushaija! <verse eid="JHN 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Abafarisaayo baabagarukamu bati: Kandi shi naimwe yaabahabya? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:48: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:42">Yoh 12:42</ref>. </char></note> Hariho n'omwe omu bategyeki nari omu Bafarisaayo oramwikiriize? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Kureka abo bantu, abatamanya Biragiro, n'abakeyeenirwe. <verse eid="JHN 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:50: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:1">Yoh 3:1</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 3:2">2</ref>. </char></note> Nikodemu, omwe aharibo, owaizire ahari Yesu ira, yaababuuza ati: <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />Beitu ebiragiro byaitu nibiikiriza kucwera omuntu orubanja, batabandize kuhurira eki arikwetonganira, n'obu kyakuba eki akozire? <verse eid="JHN 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:52: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:46">Yoh 1:46</ref>. </char></note> Baamugarukamu bati: Hari naiwe ori owa Galilaaya? Sherura oreebe, ku hatariho nabi oruga Galilaaya. <verse eid="JHN 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Baagyenda, buri muntu yaataaha owaabo.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s1">Omukazi owaakwatsirwe naashambana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Yesu yainamuka ekibungo kya Zeituuni. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Omu kasheeshe munonga yaagaruka omuri hekalu, abantu boona baija ah'ari; yaashutama, yaabeegyesa. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Abahandiiki n'Abafarisaayo baareeta omukazi, okwatsirwe naashambana; baamuta ahagati, <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />baamugira bati: Mwegyesa, omukazi ogu akwatsirwe butunu, naashambana. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:10">Lev 20:10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 22:22-24">Bir 22:22-24</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omu Biragiro Musa akaturagiira kuteera abarikukora batyo amabaare. Mbwenu iwe noomugambaho ki? <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Eki bakakigamba nibamutega, ngu babone eki baraamuregye. Kwonka Yesu yainama, yaahandiika n'orukumu aha itaka. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Ku baagumiizemu nibamubuuza, yaajuumuuka, yaabagira ati: omuriimwe otakashiishaga, abe niwe yaabanza kumuteera eibaare. <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Yaagaruka, yainama, yaahandiika n'orukumu aha itaka. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:22">Rom 2:22</ref>. </char></note> Bo ku baakihuriire, baashinjwa omu mitima yaabo, baashoobooka nibashohora omwe omwe, haabanza abakuru, haahereeruka abato; Yesu yaatsigara wenka n'ogwo mukazi, ahu yaabaire ari. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Yesu yaajuumuuka, yaamubuuza ati: Iwe mukazi 'we, bari nkahi? Tihariho n'omwe owaakucwera orubanja? <verse eid="JHN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:14">Yoh 5:14</ref>. </char></note> Nawe yaagarukamu ati: Tariho, Mukama wangye. Yesu yaagira ati: Naanye tindikukucwera rubanja. Kwonka irooko okuruga hati otarigaruka kushiisha.<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Omushana gw'ensi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 49:6">Isa 49:6</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:46">Yoh 12:46</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yesu yaagaruka yaabagira ati: Niinye mushana gw'ensi; orikunkuratira, tarigyendera mu mwirima, kwonka aryagira omushana gw'amagara. <verse eid="JHN 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Abafarisaayo baamugira bati: Iwe nooyehamya; kwonka okwehamya kwawe ti kw'amazima. <verse eid="JHN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:31">Yoh 5:31</ref>. </char></note> Yesu yaagarukamu, yaabagira ati: N'obu ndaabe niinyehamya, okwehamya kwangye n'okw'amazima; ahakuba nimmanya ei naarugire, kandi n'ei ndikuza; kwonka imwe timurikumanya i naarugire, nari shi ei ndikuza. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Imwe mucwa orubanja nk'abantu-buntu; nyowe tihariho n'omwe ou nducwera. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Kandi nangwa n'obu naakurucwa, okucwa okwangye n'okw'amazima, ahabw'okuba nyowe tincwa nyenka, kureka nkwatanisa na Tata owantumire. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:6">Bir 17:6</ref>. </char></note> Omu biragiro byanyu kikahandiikwa ngu obwakareebi bw'abantu babiri n'obw'amazima; <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 5:9">1 Yoh 5:9</ref>. </char></note> nyowe nyehamya, kandi Tata owantumire nawe ampamya. <verse eid="JHN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Nabo baamubuuza bati: Sho arahi? Yesu yaagarukamu ati: Timurikummanya n'obu yaakuba Tata; kuri nimummanya, na Tata mukaamumanyire. <verse eid="JHN 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Ebigambo ebyo akabigambira omu ibiikiro, naayegyesa omuri hekalu; kandi tihaabaho n'omwe owaamukwata, ahakuba obunaku bwe bukaba butakahikire.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omuheru gw'abatarikweteisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Yaagaruka yaabagira ati: Nyowe ningyenda; imwe muryansherura, kandi muryafeera omu kibi kyanyu; ei ndikuza, timurikubaasa kwijayo. <verse eid="JHN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:35">Yoh 7:35</ref>. </char></note> Abayudaaya baayebuuza bati: Beitu shi naayenda kwehanika? Ahakuba naagira ati: Ei ndikuza, timurikubaasa kwijayo. <verse eid="JHN 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Yaabagambira ati: Imwe muri ab'omu nsi, nyowe ndi ow'omu iguru; imwe muri ab'ensi egi, nyowe tindi w'ensi egi. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Nikyo naabagambirira nti: Muryafeera omu bibi byanyu; kandi buzima muryafeera omu bibi byanyu, ku muriba mutaikiriize ku ndi We. <verse eid="JHN 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Baamubuuza bati: Beitu oba oha? Yesu yaabagarukamu ati: Nk'oku naabagambiire okuruga ira ryona. <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Nyine bingi eby'okubagambaho, n'okubacwera orubanja; kwonka Ogwo owantumire n'ow'amazima, kandi ebi naahuriire ahariwe, nibyo ngambira ensi. <verse eid="JHN 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Kwonka bo tibaramanyire ku arikubagambira Ishe. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:32">Yoh 12:32</ref>. </char></note> Yesu yaabagira ati: Ku muriheza kuhanika Omwana w'omuntu, obwo nibwo murimanya ku ndi We, kandi ngu ebi nkora tiinyeragiira, kureka ngamba nk'oku Tata yaanyegyeise. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Ogwo owantumire turi hamwe; takantsigahoga nyenka, ahabw'okuba obutoosha nkora ebimushemeza. <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Ku yaagambire ebigambo ebyo, baingi baamwikiriza.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abaana ba Abrahamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Bwanyima Yesu yaagambira Abayudaaya abaamwikiriize ati: Ku muraahamire aha kigambo kyangye, nimuba muri abeegi bangye buzima; <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />kandi muryamanya mazima, n'amazima garyabahindura ab'obusingye. <verse eid="JHN 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:9">Mat 3:9</ref>. </char></note> Baamugarukamu bati: Itwe turi baijukuru ba Abrahamu; titukahakwaga muntu weena. Aho noogiriraho ota oti, Turyahinduka ab'obusingye? <verse eid="JHN 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:16">Rom 6:16</ref>. </char></note> Yesu yaabagarukamu ati: Buzimazima nimbagambira nti: Omuntu weena okora ekibi, aba omuhuuku w'ekibi. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 4:30">Gal 4:30</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omuhuuku taguma muka ebiro byona, kureka Omwana. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:18">Rom 6:18</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo Omwana ku aribahindura ab'obusingye, muryaba ab'obusingye buzima. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Nimmanya ku muri baijukuru ba Abrahamu; haza kunu nimwenda kuunyita, ahakuba ekigambo kyangye tikiine mwanya omuriimwe. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Nyowe ngamba ebi naareebire ahari Tata; naimwe mukora ebi mwahuriire ahari shoimwe. <verse eid="JHN 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Baagarukamu nibamugira bati: Abrahamu niwe tataitwe. Yesu yaabagira ati: Kuri muri abaana ba Abrahamu, mukaatwarize nk'oku Abrahamu yaatwarize. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Kwonka mbwenu nimwenda kuunyita, nyowe omuntu owaabagambira eby'amazima, ebi naahuriire ahari Ruhanga; haza kunu Abrahamu tarakozire atyo. <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Imwe nimukora emirimo ya shoimwe. Baamugira bati: Tituri baana b'obushambani; twine Tataitwe omwe, ni Ruhanga. <verse eid="JHN 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Yesu yaabagira ati: Kuri noogira ngu Ruhanga ni Shoimwe, mukaankunzire, ahakuba omu kwija nkaruga ahari Ruhanga; tindaizire habwangye, kureka Ogwo niwe yantumire. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:7">Rom 8:7</ref>. </char></note> N'enki ekirikubazibira kushoborokyerwa eki ndikugamba? N'ahabwokuba timurikubaasa kworobera kigambo kyangye. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:4">Kut 3:4</ref>. </char></note> Muri aba shoimwe <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sitaane omu Rugriika ni diabolos, amakuru ngu, Omuregi. </char></note>Sitaane, kandi mukunda kukora ebi shoimwe ayetenga. We n'omwitsi okuruga iranaira, taragumiire mu mazima, ahakuba amazima tigamubamu. Ku abeiha, aba naagamba ebye, ahakuba n'omubeihi, ishe w'ebishuba. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Kwonka nyowe ahabw'okugamba amazima, imwe timuunyikiriza. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 5:21">2 Kor 5:21</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:22">1 Pet 2:22</ref>. </char></note> N'oha ahariimwe orikunyomesereza ekibi? Ku ndaabe ningamba amazima, n'enki ekirikubazibira kuunyikiriza? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Owa Ruhanga ahurira ebigambo bya Ruhanga; imwe eki mutabihuririra n'ahabw'okuba timuri ba Ruhanga.<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Abayudaaya baamugarukamu bati: Tituhikire kukweta Omusamaria, kandi oriho daimoni? <verse eid="JHN 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Yesu yaagarukamu ati: Tindiho daimoni; nimpa Tata ekitiinisa; kwonka imwe nimungaya. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Haza nyowe tiinyesherurira kitiinisa; hariho Omwe okinsherurira, kandi niwe Mucwi w'emanja. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:51: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:24">Yoh 5:24</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:25">11:25</ref>. </char></note> Buzimazima nimbagambira nti: Omuntu ku ayorobera ekigambo kyangye, tarifa ebiro byona. <verse eid="JHN 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:52: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:1">Mak 9:1</ref>. </char></note> Abayudaaya baamugira bati: Mbwenu ho twamanya ku oriho daimoni. Abrahamu akafa, na baanabi baafa; haza ogira oti: Omuntu ku ayorobera ekigambo kyangye, tariroza ha kufa ebiro byona! <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Iwe shi, nookira tatenkuriitwe Abrahamu owaafiire, kandi na baanabi? Nooyeyeta oha? <verse eid="JHN 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Yesu yaagarukamu ati: Ku ndaabe niinyeha ekitiinisa, ekitiinisa kyangye ni busha. Tata, imwe ou mweta Ruhanga waanyu, niwe ampa ekitiinisa. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Imwe timukamumanyaga; kwonka nyowe nimmumanya; ku naakugira nti, Tindikumumanya, nkaaba omubeihi nkaimwe; kwonka nimmumanya, kandi nyorobera ekigambo kye. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Shoimwe Abrahamu akashemererwa aine ekihika ky'okureeba ekiro kyangye; ku yaakireebire, yaayesiima munonga. <verse eid="JHN 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Abayudaaya nikwo kumugarukamu bati: Tokahikize myaka makumi ataano, haza oti, nkareeba Abrahamu? <verse eid="JHN 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yesu yaabagira ati: Buzimazima nimbagambira nti: Abrahamu atakazairwe, nyowe Ndiho. <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:59: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:31">Yoh 10:31</ref>. </char></note> Okuruga aho baatorotoora amabaare kugamuteera; kwonka Yesu yaayeshereka, yaashohora omuri hekalu.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu okukiza owaazairwe ari empumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Ku yaabaire naahingura, yaareeba omushaija owaazairwe ari empumi. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Abeegi be baamubuuza bati: Rabi, owaasiisire n'oha, n'omushaija ogu, nari n'abaamuzaire, nikyo yaazaariirwe ari empumi? <verse eid="JHN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:4">Yoh 11:4</ref>. </char></note> Yesu yaagarukamu ati: Tarahumisiibwe kushiisha kwe nari okw'abazaire be, kureka kikabaho ngu emirimo ya Ruhanga eyorekyerwe ahariwe. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Tushemereire kukora emiromo y'Ogwo owantumire, bukiri nyomushana; ekiro nikiija, eki omuntu ataribaasa kukoreramu. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:35">Yoh 12:35</ref>. </char></note> Obu nkiri omu nsi, ndi Omushana gw'ensi. <verse eid="JHN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 8:23">Mak 8:23</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaaherize kugamba atyo, yaacwera amacwante aha itaka, yaagaritobesa, yaarimusiiga omu maisho, <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />yaamuragiira ati: Gyenda onaabe omu kiyanja kya Siloamu, (amakuru gaakyo ngu Otumirwe.) Yaagyenda, yaanaaba, yaagaruka naahweza. <verse eid="JHN 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Bataahi be n'abaabaire bamureeba ira naasheega, baagira bati: Ogu t'omushaija owaabaire atuura naasheega? <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Abamwe baagira ngu, Niwe; abandi ngu, Ngaaha, kwonka nibashushana. We yaagira ati: Niinye. <verse eid="JHN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Baamubuuza bati: Beitu shi, amaisho gaawe gaahumuuka gata? <verse eid="JHN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Yaagarukamu ati: Omushaija orikwetwa Yesu yaatoba eitaka, yaarinsiiga omu maisho, yangira ati: Gyenda aha kiyanja Siloamu, onaabe; naanye naagyenda, naanaaba, naahweza. <verse eid="JHN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Baamubuuza bati: Mbwenu we arahi? Yaagira ati: Tindikumanya.<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Owaabaire ari empumi baamutwara, baamuhitsya Abafarisaayo. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Kandi eizooba eri Yesu yaatobeireho eitaka, akahumuura amaisho ge, rikaba riri erya Sabato. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Abafarisaayo nabo baamubuuza oku yaahumuuka. Yaabagira ati: Yansiiga eitaka omu maisho, naanaaba, naahweza. <verse eid="JHN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 9:31">Yoh 9:31</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 9:33">33</ref>. </char></note> Abamwe aha Bafarisaayo baagira bati: Ti wa Ruhanga, ahakuba tarinda Sabato. Kwonka abandi baagira bati: Omuntu omusiisi naabaasa ata kukora obumanyiso bukuru nk'obu? Okuruga aho tibaikirizana. <verse eid="JHN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Baagaruka baabuuza owaabaire ari empumi bati: Weeza iwe, nk'oku yaakuhumuura, noomugambaho ki? Yaagira ati: Ni nabi.<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Abayudaaya baayanga kwikiriza ku yaabaire ari empumi, akahumuuka, okuhitsya obu baayetsire abazaire be, <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />bakababuuza nibagira bati: ogu ni mutabani waanyu, ou mugira ngu akazaarwa ari empumi? Mbwenu yaahumuuka ata? <verse eid="JHN 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Abazaire be baagarukamu bati: Nitumanya ngu ogu n'omwana waitu, kandi akazaarwa ahumire; <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />kwonka oku yaahumuuka hati, titurikukumanya, kandi n'owaamuhumuura, titurikumumanya. Naimwe mumwebuurize; ni mukuru, ayegambire. <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Abazaire be eki baagambiire ebyo n'ahabw'okutiina Abayudaaya; ahabw'okuba Abayudaaya bakaba baragaine ngu omuntu weena origamba Yesu ku ari Kristo, abingwe omuri sinagogi. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Abazaire be nikyo baagiriire bati, Ni mukuru; mumwebuurize. <verse eid="JHN 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Omushaija ogwo owaabaire ari empumi, baamweta obwa kabiri, baamugira bati: Himbisa Ruhanga; itwe nitumanya ngu omushaija ogwo n'omusiisi. <verse eid="JHN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Yaagarukamu ati: Ku araabe ari omusiisi, tindikumanya; eki ndikumanya ni kimwe; mbaire ndi empumi, mbwenu nimpweza. <verse eid="JHN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Baamubuuza bati: Yaakugira ata? Amaisho gaawe yaagahumuuza ki? <verse eid="JHN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Yaabagarukamu ati: Naaheza kubagambira, kwonka mwayanga kuhurira. Ahabw'enki nimwenda ngu nkigarukyemu? Naimwe nimwenda kuhinduka abeegi be? <verse eid="JHN 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Baamujuma nibagira bati: Niiwe mwegi we, itwe turi aba Musa. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Nitumanya ngu Ruhanga akagamba na Musa; kwonka omushaija ogwo titurikumanya i yaarugire. <verse eid="JHN 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Omushaija yaagarukamu naabagira ati: Ka n'eihano, imwe okutamanya i yaarugire, haza ahumwire amaisho gangye! <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:15">Isa 1:15</ref>. </char></note> Nitumanya ngu Ruhanga tahurira basiisi, kwonka omuntu weena ku amuramya, yaakora ebi akunda, ogwo Ruhanga amuhurira. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Okuruga aha kuhangwa kw'ensi tikikahurirwaga ngu hariho orahumwire amaisho g'omuntu owaazairwe ari empumi. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Omushaija ogwo ku akubaire atari wa Ruhanga, taine ki yaakubaasize kukora. <verse eid="JHN 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Baamugarukamu bati: Iwe okazaarirwa omu bibi bisha; mbwenu naiwe nooyenda kutwegyesa? Baamubinga. <verse eid="JHN 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Yesu yaahurira ku baamubinga; yaamusherura; ku yaamuboine, yaamubuuza ati: Noikiriza Omwana wa Ruhanga? <verse eid="JHN 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Yaamugarukamu ati: N'oha, Mukama wangye, nkamwikiriza? <verse eid="JHN 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:26">Yoh 4:26</ref>. </char></note> Yesu yaamugira ati: Waamureeba, niwe ogu orikugamba naiwe. <verse eid="JHN 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Yaamugira ati: Mukama wangye, niinyikiriza. Yaamuramya.<verse eid="JHN 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Yesu yaagira ati: Okucwa emanja nikwo kwandeetsire omu nsi egi, ngu abatarikureeba bareebe, kandi abarikureeba bahindukye empumi. <verse eid="JHN 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:26">Mat 23:26</ref>. </char></note> Abamwe aha Bafarisaayo abaabaire bamuri haihi baahurira ebyo bigambo, baamubuuza bati: Naitwe turi empumi? <verse eid="JHN 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:41: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 26:12">Enf 26:12</ref>. </char></note> Yesu yaabagarukamu ati: Kuri noogira ngu muri empumi, timwakugizire kibi; kwonka mbwenu ahabw'okugira muti, Nitureeba, nikyo ekibi kyanyu kirikugumiraho.<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s1">Omuriisa omurungi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />Buzimazima nimbagambira nti: Orikutaaha omu itsibikiro ry'entaama atareetsirwe mu irembo, kureka akatembera ahandi, ogwo n'omushuma kandi omwambuzi; <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />kwonka orikureetwa omu irembo niwe muriisa w'entaama. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />We omurinzi w'eirembo amwiguriraho; n'entaama zijurira eiraka rye, ayetamu eze amaziina, azishohoza aheeru. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Ku aheza kushohoza eze zoona, azeebembera, nazo zimukuratira; ahakuba zimanya eiraka rye. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Ou zitarikumanya tizimukuratira, zimuhunga; ahakuba tizirikumanya maraka g'abandi. <verse eid="JHN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 16:25">Yoh 16:25</ref>. </char></note> Yesu akabacwera enfumu egyo, kwonka tibaamanya bi yaabaire naabagambira.<verse eid="JHN 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:20">Zab 118:20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:13">Mat 7:13</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 7:14">14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yesu yaagaruka yaabagira ati: Buzimazima nimbagambira nti: Niinye irembo ry'entaama. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:1">Yer 23:1</ref>, <ref loc="JER 23:2">2</ref>. </char></note> Abambandiize boona bakaba bari abashuma kandi abambuzi, n'entaama tizirabahuriire. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Niinye irembo; omuntu weena orikutaaha naaraba omuriinye, naajunwa; naataaha, naashohora, naabona eiriisizo. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Omushuma tareetwa kindi kureka okwiba n'okwita n'okucwekyereza; nyowe nkaija ngu zigire amagara, kandi ngu zigire maingi munonga. <verse eid="JHN 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 23:1">Zab 23:1</ref>. </char></note> Niinye muriisa omurungi. Omuriisa omurungi ahayo amagara ge ahabw'entaama ze. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:11">Isa 40:11</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:11-23">Ezk 34:11-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 20:29">Byak 20:29</ref>. </char></note> Oriisiza ebihembo, atari muriisa buzima, kandi n'entaama zitari ze, ku areeba omushega nigwija, atsigaho entaama, ahunga; omushega guzishahuramu, ezindi guzitaataanisa. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Naahunga, ahabw'okuba n'oguriirwe, entaama tarikuzeetaho. <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 2:19">2 Tim 2:19</ref>. </char></note> Niinye muriisa omurungi; nimmanya ezangye, kandi n'ezangye nizimmanya; <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />nk'oku Tata arikummanya, naanye nkamanya Tata; kandi mpayo amagara gangye ahabw'ezo ntaama. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:25">1 Pet 2:25</ref>. </char></note> Nyine entaama ezindi, ezitari z'omu itsibikiro eri; nazo nshemereire kuzireeta, zihurire eiraka ryangye, zibe obusyo bumwe, n'omuriisa abe omwe. <verse eid="JHN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:8">Fil 2:8</ref>, <ref loc="PHP 2:9">9</ref>. </char></note> Tata nikyo ankundira, ahabw'okuba mpayo amagara gangye, ngu mbone kugeegarurira. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 19:11">Yoh 19:11</ref>. </char></note> Tihariho orikugaanyaka, ningahayo ahabwangye. Nyine obushoboorozi bw'okugahayo, kandi n'obw'okugeegarurira. Ekiragiro eki nkakiheebwa Tata.<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Kandi Abayudaaya baagaruka kwebaganisamu ahabw'ebigambo ebyo. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Baingi aharibo baagira bati: Ariho daimoni, agwire eiraro; nimumuhuririra ki? <verse eid="JHN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Abandi bati: Ebigambo ebi ti by'omuntu oriho daimoni. Nimugira ngu daimoni naabaasa kuhumuura amaisho g'empumi?<verse eid="JHN 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okuhamya ku aba omwe na Ishe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Obwo bukaba buri obugyenyi <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nikwo kweza hekalu, obu yaabaire esiisikaire omu ngamba z'aba Maccabees n'Omugabe Antiochus Epiphanes. </char></note>bw'Okweza hekalu omuri Yerusaalemu; <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />ebiro ebyo bikaba biri eby'embeho. Yesu yaagyendagyenda omuri hekalu omu kisasi kya Sulemaani. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Abayudaaya baamwehinguririza, baamubuuza bati: Oryahitsya hi okutubanganisisa? Ku oraabe ori Kristo, otugambirire kimwe. <verse eid="JHN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Yesu yaabagarukamu ati: Nkabagambira, kwonka timurikwikiriza. Emirimo ei ndikukora omu iziina rya Tata, niyo erikumpamya; <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />kwonka timurikwikiriza, ahakuba timuri b'omu ntaama zangye. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Entaama zangye zihurira eiraka ryangye, naanye nzimanya, nazo zinkuratira; <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:2">Yoh 17:2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:9">18:9</ref>. </char></note> nziha amagara agatahwaho, tizirihwerekyerera ebiro byona, kandi tihaine orizishahura omu mikono yangye. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Tata, owaazimpaire, naakira boona, kandi tihaine orikubaasa kuzishahura mu mikono ye. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Nyowe na Tata tuba omwe.<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 8:59">Yoh 8:59</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abayudaaya baagaruka baatorotoora amabaare kugamuteera. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Yaabagarukamu ati: Nkabooreka emirimo mingi kandi mirungi eyaarugire ahari Tata; ni guuha omuriiyo ogurikubanteeresa amabaare? <verse eid="JHN 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:65">Mat 26:65</ref>. </char></note> Abayudaaya baamugarukamu bati: Titurikukuteera mabaare ahabw'omurimo murungi, kureka ahabw'okurogota, okeegira Ruhanga, haza kunu ori omuntu. <verse eid="JHN 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 82:6">Zab 82:6</ref>. </char></note> Yesu yaabagarukamu ati: Tikirahandiikirwe omu biragiro byanyu ngu, Nkagira nti: Muri baaruhanga? <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Abo abaiziirwe ekigambo kya Ruhanga, ku araabe yaabeetsire baaruhanga, (kandi Ebyahandiikirwe tibibaasa kwihwaho,) <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:17-20">Yoh 5:17-20</ref>. </char></note> ogwo Isheboona ou yaayerize akatuma omu nsi, mumubarira okurogota, ahabw'okuba ngizire nti, Ndi Omwana wa Ruhanga? <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Ku ndaabe ntakora mirimo ya Tata, murekye kuunyikiriza; <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />kwonka ku ndaabe ngikora, n'obu muraabe mutarikuunyikiriza, mwikirize emirimo, obwo mukaashoborokyerwa, mumanya ku Tata ari omuriinye, naanye omuriwe. <verse eid="JHN 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Baateeraho kugaruka kumukwata, yaabooga omu mikono.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Yaagaruka yaayambuka Yorudani, ahu Yohaana yaabaire naabatiriza okubanza, yaagumayo. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Baingi baija ah'ari; baagira bati: Yohaana tarakozire ky'okureeberaho, kwonka byona ebi yaagambire aha muntu ogu bikaba biri eby'amazima. <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Baingi baamwikiririza okwo.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu okuzoora Laazaaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 10:38">Luk 10:38</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 10:39">39</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi hakaba hariho omushaija owaabaire arwaire, eiziina rye Laazaaro owa Besania, ekirorero eki Mariamu na mukuru we Mariza baabaire batwiremu. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:3">Yoh 12:3</ref>. </char></note> Mariamu ogwo niwe yaasiigire Mukama waitu amajuta, akamusiisirira ebigyere n'eishokye rye; kandi Laazaaro owaabaire arwaire akaba ari munyaanyabo. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Banyaanya abo bakatuma ahari Yesu, nibagira bati: Mukama waitu, ou okunda arwaire. <verse eid="JHN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 9:3">Yoh 9:3</ref>. </char></note> Yesu ku yaakihuriire, yaagira ati: Endwara egi ti y'okumwita, kureka n'ey'okuhimbisisa Ruhanga, ngu Omwana wa Ruhanga nawe ahimbisibwe ahabwayo.<verse eid="JHN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Kandi Yesu akaba akunda Mariza n'omurumuna na Laazaaro. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Ku yaahuriire ngu arwaire, yaamara kabiri ei yaabaire ari. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Bwanyima y'ebyo biro yaagira abeegi be ati: Ka tugarukye Buyudaaya. <verse eid="JHN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Abeegi be baamugira bati: Rabi, ebiro ebi Abayudaaya babaire nibenda kukuteera amabaare, kandi ogarukyeyo? <verse eid="JHN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:10">1 Yoh 2:10</ref>, <ref loc="1JN 2:11">11</ref>. </char></note> Yesu yaagarukamu ati: Omu izooba tiharimu eshaaha ikumi na ibiri? Omuntu ku agyenda nyomushana, tateera ntsibo, ahakuba areeba omushana gw'ensi egi. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Kwonka omuntu ku agyenda nyekiro, ateera entsibo, ahakuba omushana guba gutari muriwe. <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:24">Mat 9:24</ref>. </char></note> Okwo nikwo yaagambire; bwanyima yaabagira ati: Munywani waitu Laazaaro agwejegyeire; ninza kumusisiimura omu turo. <verse eid="JHN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Abeegi nikwo kumugira bati: Mukama waitu, ku araabe agwejegyeire, naija kukira. <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Kwonka Yesu akaba naagamba aha kufa kwe; haza bo baateekateeka ngu naagamba aha kugwejegyera okw'oturo. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Yesu yaabagambirira kimwe ati: Laazaaro afiire; <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />ahabwanyu nyowe niinyesiima okutabayo, mukaabona kwikiriza. Mbwenu ka tugyende ei ari. <verse eid="JHN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 10:32">Mak 10:32</ref>. </char></note> Tomasi, orikwetwa <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Didumo n'eiziina, amakuru gaaryo ngu, Empasha. </char></note>Didumo, yaagambira abeegi bagyenzi be ati: Naitwe ka tugyende, tufe nawe.<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Yesu ku yaahikireyo, yaashanga Laazaaro amazire kana omu kituuro. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Kandi Besania ekaba eri haihi na Yerusaalemu nka <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mahiro ibiri omu Rugriika ni stadio ikumi na itaano. </char></note>mahiro ibiri. <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Abayudaaya baingi bakaba baizire kuyaagira Mariza na Mariamu ahabwa munyaanyabo. <verse eid="JHN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Mariza ku yaahuriire ngu Yesu naija, yaagyenda, yaamubugana; Mariamu we yaaguma ashutami omu nju. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Mariza yaagambira Yesu ati: Mukama wangye, kuri obaire ori aha, munyaanyazi takufiire. <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Hoona na hati nimmanya ngu eki oraashabe Ruhanga kyona, naija kukikuha. <verse eid="JHN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Yesu yaamugira ati: Munyaanyoko naija kuzooka. <verse eid="JHN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:29">Yoh 5:29</ref>. </char></note> Mariza yaamugira ati: Nimmanya ku arizooka aha kuzooka okw'aha mperu. <verse eid="JHN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Yesu yaamugira ati: Niinye kuzooka n'amagara; orikuunyikiriza, n'obu yaakufa, aryaba ohuriire; <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:24">Yoh 5:24</ref>. </char></note> n'omuntu weena oriho ohuriire, kandi orikuunyikiriza, tarifa ebiro byona. Noikiriza ekyo? <verse eid="JHN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:69">Yoh 6:69</ref>. </char></note> Yaamugarukamu ati: Eego, Mukama wangye, naikiriza ku ori Kristo, Omwana wa Ruhanga, otuura ari ow'okwija omu nsi.<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Ku yaaherize kugamba atyo, yaagyenda, yaayeta Mariamu omurumuna, yaamugambira mpora ati: Omwegyesa ari aha, naakweta. <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Onu ku yaakihuriire, ahonaaho yaimuka, yaagyenda ah'ari. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Kandi Yesu akaba atakahikire mu kirorero, akiri omu mwanya ahu Mariza yaamushangire. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Abayudaaya abaabaire bari omu nju nibamuyaagira, ku baareebire Mariamu yaarahuka kwimuka yaashohora, baamukuratira nibateekateeka ngu naaza kuririra aha kituuro. <verse eid="JHN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Mariamu ku yaahikire ahu Yesu ari, yaamureeba, yaamukwata amaguru, yaamugira ati: Mukama wangye, kuri obaire ori aha, munyaanyazi takufiire. <verse eid="JHN 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Yesu ku yaamureebire naarira, n'Abayudaaya abaizire nawe nabo nibarira, yaatsinda omu mutima gwe, yaagira obusaasi. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Yaababuuza ati: Mumuziikire hi? Baamugira bati: Mukama waitu, ija oreebe. <verse eid="JHN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:41">Luk 19:41</ref>. </char></note> Yesu yaarira. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Abayudaaya baagira bati: Eshi abaire naamukunda! <verse eid="JHN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Kwonka bamwe aharibo baagira bati: Beitu omushaija ogu, owaahumwire empumi, taakubaasize kuzibira n'omuntu ogwo kufa? <verse eid="JHN 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Yesu yaagaruka yaatsinda, yaahika aha kituuro; (kikaba kiri enyanga, ekingirweho eibaare.) <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Yesu yaaragiira ati: Mwiheho eibaare. Mariza munyaanya w'ogwo nyakufa yaamugira ati: Mukama wangye, hati yaanuukire, ahabw'okuba amazire kana afiire. <verse eid="JHN 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Yesu yaamugira ati: Tinaakugira nti, Ku oraikirize, noija kureeba ekitiinisa kya Ruhanga? <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Batyo baihaho eibaare. Yesu yaimutsya amaisho ge, yaareeba ahaiguru, yaagira ati: Taata, ninkusiima, ahabw'okuba wampurira. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Kandi naamanya ku ompurira obutoosha; kwonka eki naakigamba ahabw'abantu aba abanyehinguririize, ngu baikirize ku niiwe wantumire. <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Ku yaaherize kugamba ekyo, yaagamba n'eiraka rihango ati: Laazaaro, shohora, oije. <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Nyakufa yaashohora, azingazingirwe omu myenda emikono n'amaguru, n'omutanda gukomire aha maisho ge. Yesu yaabaragiira ati: Mumukomorore, mumurekye agyende.<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abafarisaayo okugira enaama y'okwita Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Abayudaaya baingi, abaizire owa Mariamu, ku baareebire ebi Yesu yaakora, baamwikiriza; <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />kwonka abandi baagyenda aha Bafarisaayo, baabagambira ebi Yesu yaakora. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" />Abanyamurwa abakuru n'Abafarisaayo baateerana eishengyero, baagira bati: Tugire tuta? Ahakuba omushaija ogwo naakora obumanyiso bwingi. <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Ku turaamurekye yaagumizamu atyo, boona nibaija kumwikiriza, kandi Abarooma baryaija batwakye omwanya gwaitu ogurikwera, batware n'eihanga ryaitu. <verse eid="JHN 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Omwe aharibo, Kayaafa, owaabaire ari omunyamurwa omukuru omu mwaka ogwo, yaabagambira ati: Timwine ki murikumanya; <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:50: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 18:14">Yoh 18:14</ref>. </char></note> timurikwetegyereza ku kiri kirungi ahabwanyu omuntu omwe kufeera abantu, okukira eihanga ryona okuhwerekyerera. <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Ekigambo ekyo tarakigambiise bwengye bwe wenka, kwonka ahabw'okuba omunyamurwa omukuru omu mwaka ogwo, akaragura ku Yesu ashemereire kufeera eihanga eryo: <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:52: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:16">Yoh 10:16</ref>. </char></note> kandi ti ihanga eryo ryonka, kureka okuteeranira hamwe abaana ba Ruhanga abaataataine. <verse eid="JHN 11:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Okuruga aha izooba eryo baaguma nibahanuura hamwe oku baraite Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 11:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Nikyo Yesu yaarekyeire kugyendagyenda naareebwa omu Bayudaaya; akarugayo akaza omu mwanya oguri haihi n'eihamba, omuri tauni erikwetwa Efuraimu; akaguma okwo n'abeegi be.<verse eid="JHN 11:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:55: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 21:24">Byak 21:24</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 21:26">26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Okuhingurwaho kw'Abayudaaya kukaba kuri haihi; abantu baingi baaruga omu byaro, bainamuka Yerusaalemu kweyeza, Okuhingurwaho kutakahikire. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Ku baahikireyo, baatandika kusherura Yesu, nibagambirana beemereire omuri hekalu bati: Nimuteekateeka muta? Nimugira ngu tarikwija aha bugyenyi? <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Kandi abanyamurwa abakuru n'Abafarisaayo bakaba bataireho ekiragiro ngu omuntu weena ku araamanye ei ari, aije abagambire, bamukwate.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu okusiigwa amajuta omuri Besania</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:1-8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mak 14:3-9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku haabaire hatsigaireyo ebiro mukaaga okuhika aha Kuhingurwaho, Yesu yaija Besania, ahu Laazaaro, ou yaazoire omu bafu, yaabaire ari. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:40">Luk 10:40</ref>. </char></note> Okwo baamuteekyerayo eby'okurya bya nyekiro; Mariza yaaheereza, Laazaaro akaba ari omwe aha baabaire bashutami na Yesu aha by'okurya. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Mariamu yaakwata eraatiri y'amajuta g'omugaju ag'obuguzi bwingi munonga; yaagasiiga aha bigyere bya Yesu, yaabisiisiriza eishokye rye, enju yoona yaataamirana emigaju. <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Kwonka Yuda Iskaryota, omwe aha beegi be, owaabaire naayenda kumureebya, yaagira ati: <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />Ahabw'enki amajuta aga gataatundwa gakarugamu edenaari magana ashatu, zikagabirwa abooro? <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 8:3">Luk 8:3</ref>. </char></note> Taragambire atyo habw'okusaasira abooro; kureka akaba ari omushuma, kandi ahabw'okuba niwe yaabaire ahagatira enshaho, akaba atuura naakora aha byabaire biteebwamu. <verse eid="JHN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Yesu yaagira ati: Mumurekye, agabiikire ekiro ky'okuziikwa kwangye. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:11">Bir 15:11</ref>. </char></note> Abooro mutuura nabo obutoosha, kwonka nyowe timuriguma naanye obutoosha. <verse eid="JHN 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Abantu baingi omu Bayudaaya ku baamanyire ngu ari okwo, baijayo, ti habwa Yesu wenka, kureka ngu bareebe na Laazaaro, ou yaazoire omu bafu. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Abanyamurwa abakuru baahanuura kwita na Laazaaro; <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />ahabw'okuba ahabwe baingi aha Bayudaaya bakabarugamu, baikiriza Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okutaaha Yerusaalemu n'ekitiinisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:12-19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-10">Mak 11:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:29-40">Luk 19:29-40</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku bwaseesire, omutwe muhango gw'abantu, abaabaire baizire aha bugyenyi, ku baahuriire ngu Yesu naija Yerusaalemu, <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />baatwara amataagi g'enkindo, baaza kumubugana, nibeeshongora bati: Hosana! Orikwija omu iziina rya Mukama asiimwe, niwe Mugabe wa Israeli! <verse eid="JHN 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Zek 9:9</ref>. </char></note> Yesu, ku yaareebire omwana gw'endogoya, yaagutembaho, nk'oku kyahandiikirwe ngu, <verse eid="JHN 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" />Otatiina, iwe Saayuuni, reeba Mukama waawe naija, atembire omwana gw'endogoya. <verse eid="JHN 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:39">Yoh 7:39</ref>. </char></note> Okubanza abeegi be tibarashoborokyeirwe ebyo; kwonka Yesu, ku yaaherize kuhimbisibwa, baabona kwijuka ngu ebyo byona bikamuhandiikwaho, kandi byamukorerwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Kandi omutwe gw'abantu abaabaire bariho obu yaayeta Laazaaro okuruga omu kituuro, akamuzoora omu bafu, baabihamya. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />N'ahabw'ekyo omutwe gw'abantu gwaza kumubugana, ahakuba bakaba bahuriire ku akozire akamanyiso ako. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Abafarisaayo nikwo kugambirana bati: Mureebe ku mutakiine ky'okukora; reeba, ensi yoona yaamukuratira.<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abagriika okwetenga kureeba Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Kandi omuri abo abaizire aha bugyenyi kuramya, hakaba harimu Abagriika. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:3">Luk 19:3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:8">23:8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:44">Yoh 1:44</ref>. </char></note> Abo baija ahari Filipo owa Besesaida ey'omuri Galilaaya, baamushaba nibagira bati: Taata, nitwenda kureeba Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Filipo yaija yaabigambira Anderea. Anderea yaija na Filipo, baabigambira Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Yesu yaabagarukamu ati: Obunaku bwahika Omwana w'omuntu kuhimbisibwa. <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:36">1 Kor 15:36</ref>. </char></note> Buzimazima nimbagambira nti: Akajuma k'engano, ku kaba katagwire mu itaka, kakafa, kagumaho konka; kwonka ku kafa, kaana ebyana bingi. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mat 10:39</ref>. </char></note> Orikukunda amagara ge, aryagabuza; kandi ogwo orikwanga amagara ge omu nsi egi, aryagarinda okuhitsya aha magara agatahwaho. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:3">Yoh 14:3</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu weena ku araabe nampeereza, ankuratire; kandi ahi ndi, n'omuheereza wangye niho ariba; omuntu weena ku ampeereza, Tata aryamuha ekitiinisa.<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 42:5">Zab 42:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu omutima gwangye gwine obusaasi; kandi ngambe ki? Ngire nti, Taata, njuna ntahika aha bunaku obu? Ngaaha, ahakuba eki naiziire n'okubuhikaho. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat 3:17</ref>. </char></note> Taata, himbisa eiziina ryawe. Omu mwanya ogwo eiraka ryayema omu iguru, nirigira riti: Naarihimbisa, kandi ndyagaruka ndihimbise. <verse eid="JHN 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Abantu abaabaire beemereire aho, baarihurira, baagira bati, Eiguru ryahinda. Abandi bati: Ni maraika owaagamba nawe. <verse eid="JHN 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Yesu yaagarukamu naagira ati: Eiraka eri ryaija ahabwanyu, ti habwangye. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:30">Yoh 14:30</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 16:11">16:11</ref>. </char></note> Hati ensi egi yaacwerwa orubanja; hati omutegyeki w'ensi egi naija kubingwa; <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:28">Yoh 8:28</ref>. </char></note> naanye ku ndiihwa aha nsi naahanikwa, ndyairiza abantu boona ahariinye. <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Ekyo akakigamba kworeka okufa oku yaabaire naija kufa. <verse eid="JHN 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:14">Dan 7:14</ref>. </char></note> Abantu baamugarukamu bati: Omu Biragiro tukahurira ngu Kristo agumaho ebiro byona. Kandi noobaasa ota kugamba ngu Omwana w'omuntu ashemereire kuhanikwa? Omwana w'omuntu ogwo n'oha? <verse eid="JHN 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:12">Yoh 8:12</ref>. </char></note> Yesu yaabagira ati: Hatsigaire omwanya mukye ogu mukiiniiremu omushana; mugyende mukiine omushana, obwire butakaabairirira omu muhanda; ogyendera omu mwirima, tamanya i arikuza. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:8">Efe 5:8</ref>. </char></note> Obu mukiine omushana, mwikirize omushana, mubone kuba abaana b'omushana. Yesu ku yaaherize kugamba ekyo, yaarugayo, yaabeeshereka.<verse eid="JHN 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abataraikiriize Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Kwonka n'obu araabe yaakozire obumanyiso bwingi omu maisho gaabo, hoona nabwo tibaramwikiriize, <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Isa 53:1</ref>. </char></note> ngu ekigambo kya nabi Isaaya kihikiirire, eki yaagambire ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">Mukama, n'oha oikiriize ebigambo byaitu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">Kandi omukono gwa Mukama gukashuuruurirwa oha?<verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:39: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 6:9">Isa 6:9</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 6:10">10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo baremeirwe okwikiriza, ahakuba Isaaya akagaruka yaagira ati:<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />Akabahumya amaisho, yaagangaaza emitima yaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">Ngu barekye kureeba n'amaisho, n'okwetegyereza n'emitima yaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">N'okuhinduka, ngu mbakize.<verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:41: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 6:1">Isa 6:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Isaaya akagamba ekyo, ahakuba akareeba ekitiinisa kye, yaamugambaho. <verse eid="JHN 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Baingi nangwa n'abakuru baamwikiriza; kwonka ahabw'okutiina Abafarisaayo tibaakigamba, ngu batabingwa omuri sinagogi; <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:44">Yoh 5:44</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba bakenda kusiimwa abantu okukira okusiimwa Ruhanga.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Yesu yaagamba n'eiraka rihango ati: Orikuunyikiriza, tiinye arikuba aikiriize, kureka Ogwo owantumire. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:45: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:9">Yoh 14:9</ref>. </char></note> Kandi orikundeeba, naaba areebire Owantumire. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Nyowe nyizire omu nsi kuba omushana, ngu omuntu weena orikuunyikiriza arekye kuguma omu mwirima. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:47: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 9:56">Luk 9:56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:15">Yoh 8:15</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu weena ku ahurira ebi ngamba, ataabyorobera, nyowe timmucwera rubanja; ahakuba tindaizire kucwera nsi rubanja, kureka okugijuna. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:48: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 4:12">Heb 4:12</ref>. </char></note> Orikuunyanga, akanga n'ebigambo byangye, aine orikumucwera orubanja; ekigambo eki naagambire, nikyo kirimucwera orubanja aha kiro ky'aha mperu. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Ahakuba tindagambire habwangye; Tata owantumire niwe yandagiire eky'okugamba, n'oku ndaakigambe. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Nimmanya ngu ekiragiro kye n'amagara agatahwaho; n'ahabw'ekyo ebi ngamba, mbigamba nk'oku Tata yaabingambiire.<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu okunaabisa abeegi be ebigyere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 15:13">Yoh 15:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obugyenyi bw'Okuhingurwaho butakahikire, Yesu akamanya ku obunaku bwe buhikire okuruga omu nsi egi kugaruka ahari Ishe. Ku yaakunzire abe ab'omu nsi, yaagumizamu naabakunda okuhitsya aha muheru. <verse eid="JHN 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:3">Luk 22:3</ref>. </char></note> Ku baabaire nibarya eby'okurya bya nyekiro, Sitaane yaaherize kwosya omutima gwa Yuda Iskaryota, mwene Simooni, kumureebya; <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:2">Yoh 17:2</ref>. </char></note> na Yesu yaamanyire ngu Ishe amurekuriire byona, kandi ngu akaruga ahari Ruhanga, kandi naagaruka ahari Ruhanga, <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:37">Luk 12:37</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:28">Mat 20:28</ref>. </char></note> yaaruga aha by'okurya, yaajuura eby'okujwara bye, yaakwata ekitambaara, yaakyezirika omunda. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Yaashuka amaizi aha kinaabiro, yaatandika kunaabisa abeegi be ebigyere n'okubiragarisa ekitambaara eki yaabaire ayezirikiise. <verse eid="JHN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 5:3">1 Pet 5:3</ref>. </char></note> Atyo yaahika ahari Simooni Petero. Petero yaamubuuza ati: Mukama wangye, hoona Iwe kunnabisa ebigyere! <verse eid="JHN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Yesu yaagarukamu naamugira ati: Eki ndikukora torikukimanya; kwonka oryakimanya bwanyima. <verse eid="JHN 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Petero yaamugira ati: Reka! Torinnabisa bigyere ebiro byona. Yesu yaamugarukamu ati: Ku ndaabe ntakunaabiise, nituba tutakikwatanisa. <verse eid="JHN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Simooni Petero yaamugira ati: Mukama wangye, kyabaire kityo, otannaabisa ebigyere byonka, kureka n'emikono n'omu mutwe. <verse eid="JHN 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Yesu yaamugira ati: Owaayogire, tashemereire kindi kureka okunaaba aha bigyere byonka; ahabw'okuba aba naayera weena; kandi imwe nimwera, kwonka ti mwena. <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:64">Yoh 6:64</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 6:70">70</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 6:71">71</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba akaba naamanya oraamureebye; nikyo yaagiriire ati: Mwena timurikwera.<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Ku yaaherize kubanaabisa ebigyere, yaajwara ebijwaro bye, yaagaruka omu mwanya gwe, yaababuuza ati: Nimumanya eki naabakorera? <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:8">Mat 23:8</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 23:10">10</ref>. </char></note> Muunyeta Omwegyesa kandi Mukama waanyu; kandi eki murikugamba nikyo, ahabw'okuba nikwo ndi. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:27">Luk 22:27</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:10">1 Tim 5:10</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu ku ndaabe naabanaabisa ebigyere, haza ndi Mukama waanyu kandi Omwegyesa waanyu, naimwe kibashemereire kunaabisana ebigyere; <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:21">1 Pet 2:21</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba naabaha eky'okureeberaho, ngu naimwe mukore nk'oku naabakorera. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Buzimazima nimbagambira nti: Omuhuuku takira mukama we; kandi n'entumwa tekira ogitumire. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:24">Mat 7:24</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 1:25">Yak 1:25</ref>. </char></note> Ku muraabe nimumanya ebyo, muhiiriirwe mwaba nimubikora.<verse eid="JHN 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okugamba orikwenda kumureebya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 41:9">Zab 41:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Tindikubagambaho mwena; nimmanya abu naatooraine; kwonka Ekyahandiikirwe kihikiirire ngu, Owaarya aha by'okurya byangye, niwe ambangiire omugyere. <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Nimbagambira eki hati, kitakabaireho, ngu ku kiriba kyabaireho, mwikirize ngu ndi Ogwo. <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Buzimazima nimbagambira nti: Oyakiira omuntu weena ou ntuma, biri niinye ayakiire; kandi onyakiira, biri ayakiire Ogwo owantumire.<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:21-30: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:21-25">Mat 26:21-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:18-21">Mak 14:18-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luk 22:21-23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yesu ku yaaherize kugamba atyo, yaashoberwa omu mutima, yaahamya ati: Buzimazima nimbagambira nti: Omwe ahariimwe naija kundeebya. <verse eid="JHN 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Abeegi baareebana, nibabanganisa aha u yaagambaho. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Kandi omwe aha beegi be ou Yesu yaabaire akunda, akaba amwegamiire omu kifuba, bari aha by'okurya. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Simooni Petero yaamwitira eriisho, yaamugira ati: Tugambire ou yaagambaho. <verse eid="JHN 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Ogwo, nk'oku yaabaire ayegamiire Yesu omu kifuba, yaamubuuza ati: Mukama wangye, n'oha? <verse eid="JHN 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Yesu yaagarukamu ati: Ou ndaakoreze ekitongye, nkakimuha, niwe ogwo. Ku yaakorize ekitongye, yaakiha Yuda mwene Simooni Iskaryota. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Ku yaaherize kuheebwa ekitongye, Sitaane yaamutaahamu. Nikyo Yesu yaamugiriire ati: Eki orikwenda kukora, kirahutsye. <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Omuri abo abaabaire bashutami aha by'okurya, tihariho n'omwe owaamanyire eki yaamugambiriire ekyo. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:6">Yoh 12:6</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba Yuda niwe yaabaire arinda enshaho y'empiiha, abamwe baateekateeka ngu Yesu yaamuragiira kugura ebirikwetengwa aha bugyenyi, nari shi kugira eki yaaha abooro. <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Yuda, ku yaaherize kwakiira ekitongye, ahonaaho yaashohora; kandi bukaba bwaizire.<verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Ku yaaherize kushohora, Yesu yaagira ati: Hati mbwenu Omwana w'omuntu yaahimbisibwa, na Ruhanga yaahimbisizibwa omuriwe; <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:1-5">Yoh 17:1-5</ref>. </char></note> kandi Ruhanga ku araabe yaahimbisizibwa omu Mwana we, naija kuhimbisa Omwana we omuriwe, amuhimbise ahonaaho. <verse eid="JHN 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />Baana bato 'mwe, nkiri naimwe omwanya mukye; muryansherura; kandi nk'oku naagambiire Abayudaaya, naimwe nikwo ndikubagambira nti: Ei ndikuza, timurikubaasa kwijayo. <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:8">1 Yoh 2:8</ref>, <ref loc="1JN 2:10">10</ref>. </char></note> Nimbaha ekiragiro kisya nti: Mukundane; nk'oku naabakunzire, naimwe mube nikwo mwakundana. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Ku muriguma nimukundana, nibwo abantu boona baribamanya ku muri abeegi bangye.<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okugamba ahari Petero oku araamwehakane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:36-38: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:33-35">Mat 26:33-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:29-31">Mak 14:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22:31-34</ref>. </char>
    </note> Simooni Petero yaamubuuza ati: Mukama wangye, nooza hi? Yesu yaagarukamu ati: Ei ndikuza, torikubaasa kunkuratayo hati; kwonka oryankurata bwanyima. <verse eid="JHN 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Petero yaamugambira ati: Mukama wangye, n'enki ekirikunzibira kukukuratayo hati? Niinyija kuhayo amagara gangye ahabwawe. <verse eid="JHN 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Yesu yaamugarukamu ati: Noija kuhayo amagara gaawe ahabwangye? Buzimazima ninkugambira nti: Enkoko terikwija kugamba, otakanyehakaine kashatu.<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s1">Omuhanda, n'amazima, n'amagara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />Emitima yaanyu etarishoberwa; mwikirize Ruhanga, naanye muunyikirize. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Omu nju ya Tata harimu emyanya mingi ey'okutuuramu; kuri kitari kityo, nkaabagambiire; hati ninza kubashemereza omwanya. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 17:24">Yoh 17:24</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ku ndaabe ninza kubashemereza omwanya, ndyagaruka aha, mbatware ei ndi; okwo ei ndi, naimwe mube niyo mwatuura. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Kandi ei ndikuza, omuhanda nimugumanya. <verse eid="JHN 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Tomasi yaamubuuza ati: Mukama wangye, ka tutarikumanya i orikuza, omuhanda nitugumanya tuta? <verse eid="JHN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:20">Heb 10:20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:25">Yoh 11:25</ref>. </char></note> Yesu yaamugambira ati: Niinye muhanda, n'amazima, n'amagara; tihariho oija ahari Isheboona, atarabire muriinye. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Kuri mwammanyire, na Tata nawe mukaamumanyire. Okuruga hati nimumumanya, kandi mwamureeba. <verse eid="JHN 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Filipo yaamugira ati: Mukama wangye, tworekye Isheboona; ekyo nikitumara. <verse eid="JHN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 1:3">Heb 1:3</ref>. </char></note> Yesu yaamubuuza ati: Filipo, ahi nakatuurira naimwe, tokammanyaga? Ondeebire, biri areebire Isheboona; n'enki ekirikukushabisa oti, Otworekye Isheboona? <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Torikwikiriza ku ndi omuri Tata, kandi na Tata ku ari omuriinye? Ebigambo ebi mbagambira timbyetuma, kureka Tata ori omuriinye niwe akora emirimo ye. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:25">Yoh 10:25</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 10:38">38</ref>. </char></note> Muunyikirize ku ndi omuri Tata, na Tata ku ari omuriinye; nari shi muunyikirize ahabw'emirimo yonka. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Buzimazima nimbagambira nti: Orikuunyikiriza, emirimo ei nkora nawe aryagikora, kandi aryakora erikukira eyangye obuhango, ahabw'okuba nyowe ningyenda ahari Tata. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 5:14">1 Yoh 5:14</ref>. </char></note> Kandi kyona eki murishaba omu iziina ryangye, ndyakikora, Isheboona abone kuhimbisibwa omu Mwana. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Ku murishaba ekintu kyona omu iziina ryangye, ndyakikora.<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okuraganisa Omwoyo Orikwera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1JN 5:3">1 Yoh 5:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku muraabe nimunkunda, nimwija kukwata ebiragiro byangye. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:26">Yoh 15:26</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 16:7">16:7</ref>. </char></note> Naanye ndyashaba Tata, nawe aryabaha Omuhwezi ondiijo, agume naimwe obutwire bwona. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:39">Yoh 7:39</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 8:26">Rom 8:26</ref>. </char></note> Omuhwezi ogwo n'Omwoyo ow'amazima, ou ensi etarikubaasa kwakiira, ahakuba temureeba n'obu kwakuba okumumanya; kwonka imwe mumumanya; ahakuba aguma naimwe, kandi aryatuura omuriimwe. <verse eid="JHN 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />Tindibatsiga muri efuuzi; ndyaija ahi muri. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 16:16">Yoh 16:16</ref>. </char></note> Hatsigaire omwanya mukye, ensi okutandeeba bundi; kwonka imwe muryandeeba; ahabw'okuba ndi ohuriire, naimwe muryaba abahuriire. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Aha kiro ekyo muryamanya ku ndi omuri Tata, naimwe ku muri omuriinye, naanye omuriimwe. <verse eid="JHN 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />Oine ebiragiro byangye akabyorobera niwe arikunkunda; kandi orikunkunda, aryakundwa Tata, naanye ndyamukunda, mmweyorekye. <verse eid="JHN 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Yuda, otari Iskaryota, yaamubuuza ati: Mukama wangye, kibaire kita iwe okutweyoreka, oteeyorekye nsi? <verse eid="JHN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 6:16">2 Kor 6:16</ref>. </char></note> Yesu yaamugarukamu ati: Omuntu ku arikunkunda, aryarinda ekigambo kyangye, na Tata aryamukunda; kandi turyaija ahariwe, tutuure nawe. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Otarikunkunda, tarinda bigambo byangye; kandi ekigambo eki muhurira ti kyangye; n'ekya Tata owantumire.<verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okuraga abeegi be</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />Ebigambo ebi naabibagambira nkibaine. <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:19">Mat 10:19</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Omuhwezi, Omwoyo Orikwera, ou Isheboona aryohereza omu iziina ryangye, niwe aribeegyesa byona, akabaijutsya byona ebi naabagambiire. <verse eid="JHN 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 4:7">Fil 4:7</ref>. </char></note> Nimbatsigira obusingye; obusingye bwangye nimbubaha; tindikubaha nk'oku ensi eha. Emitima yaanyu etarishoberwa, n'obu kwakuba okutiina. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:3">Yoh 14:3</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 14:18">18</ref>. </char></note> Mwahurira ku naabagambira nti, Ningyenda, kandi ndyagaruka ahu muri. Kuri nimunkunda, mukaashemereirwe, ahabw'okuba ninza ahari Tata; kandi Tata nankira. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Hati naakibagambira kitakabaireho, ngu ku kiriba kyahikire, mukiikirize. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:2">Efe 2:2</ref>. </char></note> Tinkigamba bingi naimwe, ahabw'okuba omutegyeki w'ensi egi naija, kwonka taanyineho bushoboorozi. <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />Nyowe nkora nk'oku Tata yandagiire, ngu ensi emanye ku mmukunda. Mwimukye, turugye aha.<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'Omuzaabibu gw'amazima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 80:8">Zab 80:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nyowe ndi omuzaabibu gw'amazima, na Tata niwe muhingi. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Buri itaagi eriri omuriinye, eritaana byana, aritemaho; kandi buri itaagi eryana ebyana, arisharira ngu rikizeho kwana. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Hati mwaheza kushemezibwa ahabw'ekigambo eki naabagambira. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Mugume omuriinye, naanye omuriimwe. Nk'oku eitaagi ritabaasa kwana byana ryonka, ryaba ritagumire ha muzaabibu, nikwo naimwe mutarikubaasa, mwaba mutagumire muriinye. <verse eid="JHN 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 3:5">2 Kor 3:5</ref>. </char></note> Niinye muzaabibu, naimwe muri amataagi. Oguma omuriinye, naanye omuriwe, ogwo niwe ayana ebyana bingi; ahakuba nyowe ahu ntari, timwine ki murikubaasa kukora. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:10">Mat 3:10</ref>. </char></note> Omuntu ku aba atagumire muriinye, anagwa nk'eitaagi, kandi ayoma; ago mataagi gashangurizibwa, ganagwa omu muriro, gasya. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 11:24">Mak 11:24</ref>. </char></note> Ku muraagume omuriinye, n'ebigambo byangye byaguma omuriimwe, mushabe kyona eki murikwenda, kiryabakorerwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Ekihimbisisa Tata, kikahamya ku muri abeegi bangye, niimwe okwana ebyana bingi.<verse eid="JHN 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebya rukundo ya Yesu n'abeegi be</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Nk'oku Tata yankunzire, naanye nikwo naabakunzire; mugume omu kukunda kwangye. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:29">Yoh 8:29</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 2:4">1 Yoh 2:4</ref>. </char></note> Ku muriguma nimworobera ebiragiro byangye, muryaguma omu kukunda kwangye, nkaanye oku ntuura niinyorobera ebiragiro bya Tata, nkaguma omu kukunda kwe. <verse eid="JHN 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />Ebi naabibagambira, ngu okushemererwa kwangye kube omuriimwe, kandi ngu okushemererwa kwanyu kube okuhikire. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 3:11">1 Yoh 3:11</ref>. </char></note> Eki nikyo kiragiro kyangye, mukundane nk'oku naabakunzire. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 3:16">1 Yoh 3:16</ref>. </char></note> Tihariho rukundo erikukira egi, omuntu okufeera banywani be. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:31">Yoh 8:31</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:50">Mat 12:50</ref>. </char></note> Imwe muri banywani bangye, ku muraabe nimukora ebi ndikubaragiira. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Tinkibeeta bahuuku, ahakuba omuhuuku tamanya ki mukama we akora; kureka mbeetsire banywani bangye, ahakuba byona ebi naagambiirwe Tata, mbibamanyiise. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Timwe mwantooraine; niinye naabatooraine, nkabataho ngu mugyende mwane ebyana, kandi ngu ebyana byanyu bigumeho; n'ahabw'ekyo kyona eki murishaba Isheboona omu iziina ryangye, aryakibaha. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Ebi nimbibaragiira ngu mukundane.<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okwangwa ensi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1JN 3:13">1 Yoh 3:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ensi ku eribanga, mumanye ngu ekabanza kuunyanga etakabangire. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 6:22">Luk 6:22</ref>. </char></note> Kuri muri ab'ensi, ensi ekaabakunzire, ahabw'okuba abaayo; kwonka ahabw'okuba timuri b'ensi, kandi nkabatoorana kubaiha omu b'ensi, nikyo ensi erikubangira. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:24">Mat 10:24</ref>. </char></note> Mwijukye ekigambo eki naabagambiire nti: Omuhuuku takira mukama we. Ku baraabe bampiigire, naimwe baryabahiiga; ku baraabe baarinzire ekigambo kyangye, n'ekyanyu baryakirinda. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 16:3">Yoh 16:3</ref>. </char></note> Ebyo byona baryabibakora nibabatura eiziina ryangye, ahabw'okuba tibarikumanya Owantumire. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Kuri ntaraizire, nkagamba nabo, tibaakugizire kibi; kwonka hati tibaine ky'okwetonganira ahabw'ekibi kyabo. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 2:23">1 Yoh 2:23</ref>. </char></note> Orikuunyanga, naaba ayangire na Tata. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:11">Yoh 14:11</ref>. </char></note> Kuri ntarakozire muribo emirimo etakakorwaga ondiijo, tibaakugizire kibi; kwonka hati bagireebire, baayogaho baanyanga na Tata. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:4">Zab 69:4</ref>. </char></note> Byona bibaireho ngu ekigambo ekyahandiikirwe kihikiirire, ekirikugira kiti: Bakanyangira busha. <verse eid="JHN 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />Kwonka Omuhwezi ku ariija, ou ndibooherereza okuruga ahari Isheboona, Omwoyo ow'amazima orikuruga ahari Tata, ogwo aryahamya ebyangye; <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:32">Byak 5:32</ref>. </char></note> naimwe muri baakareebi, ahabw'okuba okuruga aha kutandika mukaba muri hamwe naanye.<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="s1">Okuhiigwa kw'abeegi, n'omugasho gw'Omwoyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />Ebi naabibagambira ngu mutarishoberwa. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 9:22">Yoh 9:22</ref>. </char></note> Baryababinga omuri sinagogi; kandi obunaku buryahika, omuntu weena oribaita aryateekateeka ngu naakorera Ruhanga. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Ekyo baryakikora, ahabw'okuba tibaramanyire Isheboona n'obu yaakuba nyowe. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Ebi naabibagambira, ngu obunaku bwabyo ku buriba bwahikire, mwijukye ku naabibagambiire. Ebigambo ebyo tindabibagambiire ha kutandika, ahabw'okuba nkaba nkibaine. <verse eid="JHN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Mbwenu hati ningyenda ahari Ogwo owantumire; kwonka tihaine n'omwe omuriimwe orikumbuuza ati: Nooza hi? <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Emitima yaanyu eijwire obusaasi, ahakuba naabagambira ebigambo ebi. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:16">Yoh 14:16</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 14:26">26</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka nimbagambira amazima; ni kirungi ahabwanyu nyowe kugyenda; ahakuba nyowe ku ndiba ntagyenzire, Omuhwezi taribaizira; kwonka ku ndigyenda, ndyamubooherereza. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 4:12">Heb 4:12</ref>. </char></note> We ku ariija aryayomesereza ensi ekibi, n'okuhikiirira, n'orubanja; <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:18">Yoh 3:18</ref>. </char></note> ekibi, ahabw'okutaanyikiriza; <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:25">Rom 4:25</ref>. </char></note> okuhikiirira, ahakuba ningyenda ahari Tata, kandi nimuba mutakindeeba; <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:31">Yoh 12:31</ref>. </char></note> n'orubanja, ahakuba omutegyeki w'ensi egi aherize kucwerwa orubanja.<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 3:1">1 Kor 3:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nkiine bingi kubagambira, kwonka timurikubaasa kubyemera hati. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Kureka Omwoyo ow'amazima ku ariija, aryabeebembera omu mazima goona, ahakuba taryetuma; kwonka byona ebi arihurira, nibyo arigamba, kandi aryabamanyisa ebiriija kubaho. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Aryampimbisa, ahakuba aryaiha aha byangye, abibamanyise. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Ebi Tata aine byona n'ebyangye; nikyo naabagirira nti, Aryaiha aha byangye, abibamanyise. <verse eid="JHN 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />Hatsigaire omwanya mukye kutandeeba; kandi ogundi mukye, muryandeeba. <verse eid="JHN 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Bamwe aha beegi be baagambirana bati: Eki arikutugambira n'enki ati, Hatsigaire omwanya mukye kutandeeba; kandi ati, Ogundi mukye, muryandeeba; kandi ati: Ahakuba ningyenda ahari Isheboona? <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Baagaruka baagira bati: Eki arikugamba n'enki ati, Hatsigaire omwanya mukye? Titurikumanya ki arikugamba. <verse eid="JHN 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Yesu yaamanya ku barikwenda kumubuuza, yaabagira ati: Nimubuuzana aha ki naabagira nti, Hatsigaire omwanya mukye, kutandeeba; kandi nti, Ogundi mukye, muryandeeba? <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Buzimazima nimbagambira nti: Muryarira mucure, kwonka ensi eryashemererwa; muryagira obusaasi, kwonka obusaasi bwanyu buryahinduka okushemererwa. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Omukazi, ku arumwa kuzaara, agira obusaasi, ahakuba obunaku bwe buba buhikire; kwonka ku aheza kuzaara, aba atakiijuka buri busaasi ahabw'okushemerererwa omwana ozairwe omu nsi. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:14">Isa 66:14</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo imwe mwine obusaasi hati; kwonka ndyagaruka mbareebe, emitima yaanyu eshemererwe; kandi okushemererwa kwanyu tihaine orikubaaka. <verse eid="JHN 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 5:14">1 Yoh 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:24">Mak 11:24</ref>. </char></note> Aha kiro ekyo tihariho bi murimbuuza. Buzimazima nimbagambira nti: Ku murishaba Isheboona ekintu kyona omu iziina ryangye, aryakibaha. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:11">Yoh 15:11</ref>. </char></note> Okuhitsya hati tihariho ki mwashabire omu iziina ryangye; mushabe, muryaheebwa, okushemererwa kwanyu kubone kuhikiirira.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />Ebyo naabibagambira omu nfumu; obunaku nibwija, obu ndiba ntakibagambira mu nfumu, kureka ndyabagambira ebya Tata bwerure. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Aha kiro ekyo muryashaba omu iziina ryangye; kandi tindikubagambira ku ndibashabira ahari Isheboona; <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:21">Yoh 14:21</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba Isheboona nawe abakunda, ahabw'okuba mukankunda, mwaikiriza ku naarugire ahari Isheboona. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Nkaruga ahari Isheboona, naija omu nsi; mbwenu ensi ningirugamu, ningaruka ahari Isheboona. <verse eid="JHN 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Abeegi be baagira bati: Mbwenu hati noogamba bwerure, tokigamba mu nfumu. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Hati twamanya ku omanya byona, kandi torikwetenga muntu weena kugira eki yaakubuuza; n'ahabw'ekyo nitwikiriza ku waarugire ahari Ruhanga. <verse eid="JHN 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Yesu yaabagarukamu ati: Hati nimwikiriza? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Zek 13:7</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27">Mak 14:27</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:50">50</ref>. </char></note> Reeba obunaku nibwija, kandi bwahikire, obu muritaataanisizibwamu, buri muntu omu ka ye, mukantsiga nyenka; kwonka tindi nyenka, ahabw'okuba Tata ari hamwe naanye. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 5:1">Rom 5:1</ref>. </char></note> Ebi naabibagambira ngu mugire obusingye omuriinye. Omu nsi mwine obusaasi; kwonka muhuumure, nyowe nsingwire ensi.<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu okushabira abeegi be</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Yesu ku yaaherize kugamba ebigambo ebyo, yainamura amaisho, yaareeba ahaiguru, yaagira ati: Taata, obunaku bwahika; himbisa Omwana waawe, n'Omwana abone kukuhimbisa, <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />nk'oku waamuhaire obushoboorozi aha bantu boona, ngu abone kuha abu waamuhaire boona amagara agatahwaho. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 5:20">1 Yoh 5:20</ref>. </char></note> Aga nigo magara agatahwaho, okumanya iwe Ruhanga omwe ow'amazima, n'Ogwo ou waatumire, Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:34">Yoh 4:34</ref>. </char></note> Nkuhaisize ekitiinisa omu nsi, ahabw'okuba omurimo ogu wampaire kukora nguhikiriize. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:6">Fil 2:6</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu, Taata, mpimbisa omu maisho gaawe n'ekitiinisa ekyo eki naabaire nyine naiwe, ensi etakahangirwe.<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />Abashaija, abu wampaire omu nsi, nkabooreka eiziina ryawe; bakaba bari abaawe, waabampa, kandi barinzire ekigambo kyawe. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Hati bamanyire ngu byona ebi wampaire biruga ah'ori; <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />ahakuba ebigambo ebi wampaire mbibahaire, baabiikiriza, baamanya omu mazima ku naarugire ah'ori, kandi baikiriza ngu niiwe wantumire. <verse eid="JHN 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:44">Yoh 6:44</ref>. </char></note> Abo nibo ndikushabira; tindikushabira b'ensi, kureka abo abu wampaire, ahakuba n'abaawe; <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />abangye boona n'abaawe, n'abaawe n'abangye, kandi nimpimbisibwa omuribo. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Mbwenu hati tinkiri mu nsi, kwonka bo bari omu nsi, kandi niinyija ah'ori. Taata orikwera, obarindire omu iziina ryawe eri wampaire, babe bamwe nkaitwe oku turi bamwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:39">Yoh 6:39</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 41:9">Zab 41:9</ref>. </char></note> Obu naabaire nkibaine, nkabarindira omu iziina ryawe eri wampaire; nkabarinda, tihaine n'omwe owaabuzire, kureka omwana ow'okuhwerekyerera, ngu Ebyahandiikirwe bihikiirizibwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:11">Yoh 15:11</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu niinyija ah'ori; ebi nimbigamba nkiri omu nsi, ngu okushemererwa kwangye kuhikiirizibwe omuribo. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:19">Yoh 15:19</ref>. </char></note> Mbahaire ekigambo kyawe; ensi yaabanga, ahabw'okuba ti b'ensi, nk'oku naanye ntari w'ensi. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:32">Luk 22:32</ref>. </char></note> Tindikukushaba ngu obaihe omu nsi, kureka ngu obarinde Omubi. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Ti b'ensi, nk'oku naanye ntari w'ensi. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Obeeze omu mazima; ekigambo kyawe nigo mazima. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 20:21">Yoh 20:21</ref>. </char></note> Nk'oku wantumire omu nsi, naanye nikwo mbatumire omu nsi. <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 10:10">Heb 10:10</ref>. </char></note> Nyowe niinyeyeza ahabwabo, ngu nabo beezibwe omu mazima.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okushabira abandi abarimwikiriza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />Tindikushabira abo bonka, kureka n'abandi abariinyikiriza ahabw'ekigambo kyabo, <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:28">Gal 3:28</ref>. </char></note> ngu boona babe bamwe, nkaiwe Taata, oku ori omuriinye, naanye omuriiwe, nabo babe omuriitwe, ab'ensi babone kwikiriza ku niiwe wantumire. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Ekitiinisa eki wampaire nkibahaire, ngu babe bamwe nkaitwe oku turi bamwe, <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />nyowe omuribo, naiwe omuriinye, babeere kimwe bamwe, ab'ensi bamanye ku niiwe wantumire, okabakunda nk'oku wankunzire. <verse eid="JHN 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:4">Efe 1:4</ref>. </char></note> Taata, niinyenda ngu abu wampaire nabo bagume naanye ahi ndi, babone kureeba ekitiinisa kyangye eki wampaire; ahakuba okankunda, ensi etakahangirwe. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Taata ohikiriire, ensi terakumanyire; kwonka nyowe nkakumanya; kandi n'aba nibamanya ku niiwe wantumire. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Nkabamanyisa eiziina ryawe, kandi ndyarimanyisa, ngu okukunda, oku wankunzire, kube omuribo, naanye mbe omuribo.<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s1">Okukwata Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:1-11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-52">Mak 14:43-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22:47-53</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yesu ku yaaherize kugamba ebigambo ebyo, yaashohora n'abeegi be, baayambuka akagyera Kederoni, baaza omu musiri ogwabaire guri aho. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Kandi Yuda, owaamureebize, akaba naamanya ogwo mwanya; ahakuba Yesu kaingi akaba ateeranirayo n'abeegi be. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Mpaho Yuda, ku yaaherize kutunga omutwe gw'abaserukare n'abakuru baabo, abu yaahairwe abanyamurwa abakuru n'Abafarisaayo, baazayo baine etabaaza n'emuri n'eby'okurwanisa. <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Yesu, ku yaamanyire byona ebyaza kumubaho, yaarugayo yaababuuza ati: Nimusherura oha? <verse eid="JHN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Baamugarukamu bati: Yesu owa Nazareesi. Yesu yaabagira ati: Niinye. Yuda owaamureebize akaba ayemereire nabo. <verse eid="JHN 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Ku yaabagizire ati, Niinye, baagarura ebigyere enyima, baagwa ahansi. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Yaagaruka yaababuuza ati: Nimusherura oha? Baamugarukamu bati: Yesu owa Nazareesi. <verse eid="JHN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Yesu yaagira ati: Manya, naabagira nti: Niinye; n'ahabw'ekyo, ku muraabe nimunsherura, murekye aba bagyende. <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Akagira atyo ngu ekigambo eki yaagambire kibekwo, eki yaagizire ati: Ahari abo abu wampaire, tihariho n'omwe orambuzireho. <verse eid="JHN 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Simooni Petero, owaabaire aine rurara, yaagisyorayo, yaatema omuhuuku w'omunyamurwa omukuru, yaamucwaho okutu kwa buryo. Eiziina ry'omuhuuku ogwo akaba ari Maliko. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Yesu yaaragiira Petero ati: Garura rurara yaawe omu kyobati kyayo. Ekikopo eki Tata ampaire tindikukinywa? <verse eid="JHN 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:12-27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:57-75">Mat 26:57-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53-72">Mak 14:53-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-71">Luk 22:54-71</ref>. </char></note> Okuruga aho omutwe gw'abaserukare n'omukuru waabo n'abambari b'Abayudaaya baakwata Yesu, baamuboha. <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />Baabanza kumutwara ahari Aana; ahakuba akaba ari ishe-zaara wa Kayaafa, owaabaire ari omunyamurwa omukuru omu mwaka ogwo. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:49">Yoh 11:49</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 11:50">50</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Kayaafa ogwo niwe yaahaire Abayudaaya obwengye ati, Ni kirungi omuntu omwe kufeera abantu.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Petero okwehakana Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 3:1">Byak 3:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Simooni Petero n'omwegi ondiijo baakurata Yesu. Kandi omwegi ogwo ahabw'okumanywa omunyamurwa omukuru yaataaha hamwe na Yesu omu kibuga ky'omunyamurwa omukuru; <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />kwonka Petero yaaguma ayemereire aheeru aha irembo. Omwegi ogwo, owaabaire naamanywa omunyamurwa omukuru, yaashohora, yaagamba n'omwishiki owaabaire naakumiirira, yaataasya Petero. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Omwishiki ogwo omukumiirizi yaabuuza Petero ati: Naiwe tori omwe aha beegi b'omushaija ogu? Yaagira ati: Ngaaha, tindi mwegi we. <verse eid="JHN 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Kandi abahuuku n'abambari bakaba niboota omuriro gw'amakara, ahakuba hakaba hariho embeho; beemereire aho, niboota; na Petero ayemereire nabo naayota.<verse eid="JHN 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu omu maisho ga Aana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Omunyamurwa omukuru yaabuuza Yesu aha beegi be, n'eby'okwegyesa kwe. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:26">Yoh 7:26</ref>. </char></note> Yesu yaamugarukamu ati: Nkaba ngambira abantu butunu; nyegyesa obutoosha omuri sinagogi n'omuri hekalu, ahi Abayudaaya boona bateeranira; tinkagambaga mu mubonano. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Mbwenu nombuuriza ki? Abo abaabaire bampurira, obe nibo waabuuza ebi naabagambiire; bo nibamanya ebi naagambire. <verse eid="JHN 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:2">Byak 23:2</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 18:28-19:15">18:28—19:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:11-30">Mat 27:11-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-19">Mak 15:1-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-25">Luk 23:1-25</ref>. </char></note> Yesu ku yaagambire ekyo, omwe aha bambari, owaabaire ayemereire aho, yaamuteera oruhi, yaagira ati: Haza ogarukamu otyo omunyamurwa omukuru? <verse eid="JHN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Yesu yaamugarukamu ati: Ku ndaabe naagamba kubi, nyomesereza ekibi; mbwenu ku ndaabe naagamba gye, wanteerera ki? <verse eid="JHN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Bwanyima Aana yaamutwekyera Kayaafa omunyamurwa omukuru, abohirwe.<verse eid="JHN 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Kandi Simooni Petero akaba ayemereire naayota. Baamubuuza bati: Naiwe tori omwe aha beegi be? Yaayehakana ati: Ngaaha; tindi mwegi we. <verse eid="JHN 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Omwe aha bahuuku b'omunyamurwa omukuru, ow'omu ruganda rw'ogwo ou Petero yacwireho okutu, yaabuuza ati: Tinkureebire nawe omu musiri? <verse eid="JHN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Petero yaagaruka yaakyehakana; ahonaaho enkoko yaagamba.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu omu maisho ga Pilaato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Bwanyima baamwiha owa Kayaafa, baamutwara omuri <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Puratorio n'enju y'Abarooma ey'okucweramu emanja. </char></note>Puratorio kare nibutaagurikana. Bo tibaataaha muri Puratorio, ngu bateeshiisha, babone kurya Okuhingurwaho. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Pilaato yaashohora, yaabashanga aheeru, yaababuuza ati: Omushaija ogu nimumutabaaririza ki? <verse eid="JHN 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Baamugarukamu bati: Omushaija ogu, kuri atari nkozi y'ebibi, titwakumukuhaire. <verse eid="JHN 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Pilaato yaabagira ati: Mumwetwarire, mumucwere orubanja nk'ebiragiro byanyu oku biri. Abayudaaya baamugira bati: Ebiragiro tibitwikiriza kwita muntu. <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:19">Mat 20:19</ref>. </char></note> Ekyo kikahikiiriza ekigambo eki Yesu yaagambire okworeka okufa oku arifa.<verse eid="JHN 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Pilaato yaagaruka yaataaha omuri Puratorio, yaayeta Yesu, yaamubuuza ati: Weeza ori Omugabe w'Abayudaaya? <verse eid="JHN 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Yesu yaamubuuza ati: Ekigambo ekyo nookigamba ahabwawe, nari shi okigambiirwe abandi? <verse eid="JHN 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:11">Yoh 1:11</ref>. </char></note> Pilaato yaagarukamu ati: Noogira ngu nyowe ndi Omuyudaaya? Manya ab'eihanga ryawe n'abanyamurwa abakuru nibo baakundeetera. Ocumwire ki? <verse eid="JHN 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Yesu yaagarukamu ati: Obugabe bwangye ti bw'ensi egi: kuri obugabe bwangye bwaba buri obw'ensi egi, engabo zangye zikaarwaine, ndeka kuheebwayo omu Bayudaaya; kwonka obugabe bwangye ti bw'ensi egi. <verse eid="JHN 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 6:13">1 Tim 6:13</ref>. </char></note> Pilaato yaamugira ati: Biri shi naiwe ori Omugabe? Yesu yaagarukamu ati: Eki waagamba nikyo, ndi Omugabe. Ahakuba nikyo naiziire omu nsi, ngu mpamye amazima. Omuntu weena ow'amazima ahurira eiraka ryangye. <verse eid="JHN 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Pilaato yaamubuuza ati: Amazima n'enki? Ku yaaherize kukigamba, yaashohora, yaagaruka aha Bayudaaya, yaabagira ati: Tindikumureebaho rubanja. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Kwonka mugira omucwe ngu nshemereire kubarekurira omuntu omwe aha Kuhingurwaho; mbwenu nimwenda ngu mbarekurire Omugabe w'Abayudaaya? <verse eid="JHN 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Baagaruka baayomba, nibagira bati: T'ogu, kureka Barabba! Kandi Barabba ogwo akaba ari omwambuzi.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="s1">Pilaato okucwera Yesu orubanja rw'okufa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Bwanyima Pilaato yaatwara Yesu, baamwasha. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Ku baaherize, abaserukare baaruka ekirunga ky'amahwa, baakimujweka omu mutwe, baamujweka n'omwenda gwa bujwa; <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />baija ah'ari, baamutangirira nibagira bati: Osingire, Mugabe w'Abayudaaya! Baamuteera empi. <verse eid="JHN 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Pilaato yaagaruka yaashohora, yaabagira ati: Reeba, naaza kumubareetera, mumanye ku ntaamureebaho rubanja. <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Atyo Yesu yaashohora, ajwaire ekirunga ky'amahwa, n'omwenda gwa bujwa. Pilaato yaabagira ati: Reeba omuntu ogu! <verse eid="JHN 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Abanyamurwa abakuru n'abambari, ku baamureebire, baayomba munonga, bati: Mubambe, mubambe aha musharaba! Pilaato yaabagarukamu ati: Mumutware, mumwebambire, ahakuba tindikumureebaho rubanja. <verse eid="JHN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:18">Yoh 5:18</ref>. </char></note> Abayudaaya baamugarukamu bati: Twine ekiragiro; n'ahabw'ekiragiro ekyo ashemereire kufa, ahabw'okuba ayegizire Omwana wa Ruhanga. <verse eid="JHN 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Pilaato ku yaahuriire ebigambo ebyo, yaayeyongyera kutiina; <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />yaagaruka omuri Puratorio, yaabuuza Yesu ati: Ori owa nkahi? Kwonka Yesu tiyaamugarukamu. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Pilaato nikwo kumugambira ati: Torikungarukamu? Torikumanya ku nyine obushoboorozi bw'okukurekura nari kukubamba? <verse eid="JHN 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Yesu yaamugarukamu ati: Tokungizireho bushoboorozi, kuri otarabuhairwe okuruga omu iguru; n'ahabw'ekyo owaakumpa niwe aine ekibi ekirikukira ekyawe.<verse eid="JHN 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 17:7">Byak 17:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Okuruga aho Pilaato yaasherura oburyo bw'okumurekura; kwonka Abayudaaya baayomba munonga bati: ku oraarekure omushaija ogu, nooba otari munywani wa Kaisaari; omuntu oyegira Omugabe, aba acumwire ahari Kaisaari. <verse eid="JHN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Pilaato ku yaahuriire ebigambo ebyo, yaashohoza Yesu, yaashutama aha kitebe ky'eiramuriro omu mwanya ogurikwetwa Amabaare agaariire, omu Ruheburaayo, Gabasa. <verse eid="JHN 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Eizooba eryo rikaba riri ery'Okweteguurira Okuhingurwaho, ziri nk'eshaaha mukaaga. Pilaato yaagambira Abayudaaya ati: Reeba Omugabe waanyu! <verse eid="JHN 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Baayomba munonga nibagira bati: Mwiheho! Mwiheho! Omubambe. Pilaato yaababuuza ati: Mbambe omugabe waanyu? Abanyamurwa abakuru baamugarukamu bati; Titwine mugabe kureka Kaisaari. <verse eid="JHN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:16-30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:31-50">Mat 27:31-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:20-37">Mak 15:20-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-46">Luk 23:26-46</ref>. </char></note> Okuruga aho yaamubaha kubambwa aha musharaba.<verse eid="JHN 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okubambwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Baatwara Yesu, yaagyenda ayekoreire omusharaba gwe, baahika aha mwanya ogurikwetwa Empanga y'omutwe, omu Ruheburaayo Gologosa. <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Aho niho baamubambire, n'abandi babiri, omwe aha rubaju rumwe, n'ondi aha rundi, na Yesu ahagati. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Pilaato yaahandiika ekihandiiko; yaakita aha musharaba, nikigira kiti: YESU OWA NAZAREESI, OMUGABE W'ABAYUDAAYA. <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Ekihandiiko ekyo kikashomwa Abayudaaya baingi; ahabw'okuba omwanya ogu Yesu yaabambirwemu gukaba guri haihi n'orurembo; kandi kikaba kihandiikirwe omu Ruheburaayo n'omu Rulatini n'omu Rugriika. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Abanyamurwa abakuru b'Abayudaaya baagambira Pilaato bati: otahandiika oti, Omugabe w'Abayudaaya, kureka oti, Akagira ati: Ndi Omugabe w'Abayudaaya. <verse eid="JHN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Pilaato yaagarukamu ati: Eki naahandiikire, naakihandiikire.<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Abaserukare ku baaherize kubamba Yesu, baatwara ebijwaro bye, baabibaganisa omu miteeko ena, buri muserukare yaatwara omuteeko gwe. Kwonka ekanzu ye ekaba etaine mubaziiro, ekaba erukirwe okuruga omu bitsya okuhika ahansi. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Zab 22:18</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo baahanuura bati: Tutagitaagura, kureka tugiteerere enteenyu, tureebe oraagitware. Eki kikabaho ngu Ekyahandiikirwe kihikiirire ekirikugira kiti: Bakabagana ebijwaro byangye, baateerera ekanzu yangye enteenyu. Ebyo nibyo abaserukare baakozire.<verse eid="JHN 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okuraga Yohaana nyina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Kandi haihi n'omusharaba gwa Yesu hakaba heemereireho nyina na nyinento, na Mariamu muka Kuleopa, na Mariamu Magadaleene. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Yesu ku yaareebire nyina, kandi n'omwegi ou yaabaire akunda ayemereire haihi, yaagambira nyina ati: Mukaikuru, reeba omwana waawe! <verse eid="JHN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Kandi yaagambira omwegi ogwo ati: Reeba omukaikuru waawe! Okuruga aho omwegi ogwo yaamutwara omu ka ye.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 22:15">Zab 22:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Yesu, ku yaamanyire ngu byona byahwa, yaagira ati: Naagira eiriho! Ngu abone kuhikiiriza Ebyahandiikirwe. <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Zab 69:21</ref>. </char></note> Kandi hakaba haateekirweho enjoga eijwire viinyo erikushaarira; baagijabikamu ekyangu, baakita aha kibingo, baakimukwatira aha munwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Yesu ku yaaherize kukiheebwa, yaagira ati: Kyahwa! Yainika omutwe gwe, yaahayo amagara ge.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 21:23">Bir 21:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eizooba eryo rikaba riri ery'Okweteguura, kandi Abayudaaya bakaba batakunda mitumbi kuguma aha misharaba ahari Sabato; kandi Sabato egyo ekaba eri nkuru; Abayudaaya nikwo kushaba Pilaato kubahenda amaguru, ngu babone kuhanurwa. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Abaserukare baija, baahenda amaguru g'ow'okubanza, n'ag'owa kabiri, abaabaire babambirwe nawe; <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />kwonka ku baahikire ahari Yesu, baashanga yaakabire; tibaamuhenda maguru. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Kwonka omwe aha baserukare yaamucumita eicumu omu rubaju, ahonaaho haarugamu eshagama n'amaizi. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Owaakireebire, niwe yaakihamize, n'okuhamya kwe n'okw'amazima; kandi naamanya ku agamba amazima, ngu naimwe mwikirize. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:46">Kur 12:46</ref>. </char></note> Ebyo bikabaho, ngu Ekyahandiikirwe kihikiirire ekirikugira kiti: Tarihendwa igufa; <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Zek 12:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Kush 1:7</ref>. </char></note> kandi Ekyahandiikirwe ekindi nikigira kiti: Baryareeba ogwo ou baacumitsire.<verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuziikwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:38-42: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mak 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-55">Luk 23:50-55</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima y'ebyo Yosefu owa Arimasaaya, owaabaire ari omwegi wa Yesu, kwonka omu mubonano ahabw'okutiina Abayudaaya, yaashaba Pilaato kumwikiriza kutwara omutumbi gwa Yesu; Pilaato yaamwikiriza. Atyo yaija, yaatwara omutumbi gwe. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:39: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:2">Yoh 3:2</ref>. </char></note> Na Nikodemu, owaabandize kwija ahari Yesu nyekiro, nawe yaija, areetsire eby'omugaju ebirimu sumuruna n'enkaka, oburemeezi bwabyo nk'eraatiri igana. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Baatwara omutumbi gwa Yesu, baaguzinga omu myenda ya kitaani ei baatairemu eby'emigaju, nk'emicwe y'Abayudaaya ey'okuziika oku yaabaire eri. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Kandi omu mwanya ogu yaabaire abambirwemu hakaba harimu omusiri; n'omu musiri omwo hakaba harimu ekituuro kisya ekitakazikwamuga muntu. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Omwo nimwo baaziikire Yesu, ahabw'okuba rikaba riri eizooba ry'Okweteguura kw'Abayudaaya, kandi ekituuro ekyo kikaba kiri haihi.<verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s1">Okuzooka kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:1-18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mat 28:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-11">Mak 16:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24:1-12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aha kiro ky'okubanza omu saabiiti Mariamu Magadaleene yaija aha kituuro kare, butakaseesire; yaareeba eibaare riihirwe aha kutuuro. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />N'ahabw'ekyo yairuka, yaahika Simooni Petero n'omwegi ondiijo, ou Yesu yaabaire akunda, yaabagira ati: Baihire Mukama waitu omu kituuro, kandi titurikumanya hu bamutaire. <verse eid="JHN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Petero yaashohora n'omwegi ogwo ondiijo kuza aha kituuro. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Bombi bairuka; kwonka omwegi ogwo ondiijo yaatsiga Petero, yaamutanga aha kituuro; <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />yainama, yaaringurizamu, yaareeba emyenda ya kitaani etairwe aho, kwonka tiyaatahamu. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Bwanyima Simooni Petero yaija amukuratiire, yaataaha omu kituuro; yaareeba emyenda ya kitaani etairwe aho, <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />n'omutanda, ogwabaire guri aha mutwe gwe, gutatairwe ha myenda egyo ya kitaani, kureka gukubirwe, gutairwe aha kwagwo gwonka. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Omwegi ogwo ondiijo, owaabandize aha kituuro, nawe yaataahamu, yaareeba, yaikiriza; <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:24-32">Byak 2:24-32</ref>. </char></note> obwo bakaba batakeetegyereize Ekyahandiikirwe ngu ashemereire kuzooka omu bafu. <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Bwanyima abeegi abo baagaruka omu maka gaabo.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okweyoreka Mariamu Magadaleene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Kwonka Mariamu Magadaleene yaaguma ayemereire aha kutuuro naarira; ku yaabaire naarira, yainama yaaringuriza omu kituuro; <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />yaareeba baamaraika babiri bajwaire ebirikwera, bashutami ahu omutumbi gwa Yesu gubaire gutairwe, omwe aha mushego, n'ondiijo aha mirambikirizo. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Baamubuuza bati: Mukazi 'we, noorizibwa ki? Yaabagarukamu ati: Ahabw'okuba batwaire Mukama wangye, kandi tindikumanya i bamutaire. <verse eid="JHN 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Ku yaaherize kugamba atyo, yaahinduka, yaareeba Yesu ayemereire; kwonka tiyaamanya ku ari Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Yesu yaamubuuza ati: Mukazi 'we, noorizibwa ki? Noosherura oha? Mariamu yaateekateeka ngu n'omuhingi w'ogwo musiri, yaamugira ati: Mukama wangye, ku oraabe niiwe omutwaire, ngambira ei omutaire, nze kumwihayo. <verse eid="JHN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Yesu yaamugira ati: Mariamu. Yaahinduka, yaamugarukamu omu Ruheburaayo ati: Rabooni! (Amakuru gaakyo ngu Omwegyesa), <verse eid="JHN 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 2:11">Heb 2:11</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12">12</ref>. </char></note> Yesu yaamugira ati: Otankwata, ahakuba tinkatembire mu iguru ahari Tata; kwonka irooko ogyende aha b'eishe-emwe, obagire oti: Naatemba omu iguru ahari Ishe kandi Shoimwe, ahari Ruhanga we kandi Ruhanga waanyu. <verse eid="JHN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Mariamu Magadaleene yaagyenda, yaagambira abeegi ati: Naareeba Mukama waitu. Yaabateekyerereza n'ebi yaamugambira.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okweyoreka abeegi be ikumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:19-23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mak 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24:36-49</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eryo izooba omu mwabazyo, aha kiro ky'okubanza omu saabiiti, abeegi be bakaba beekingiraine omu nju ahabw'okutiina Abayudaaya; Yesu yaija yaabeemerera ahagati, yaabagira ati: Mugire obusingye! <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Ku yaaherize kugamba atyo, yaabooreka engaro ze n'orubaju rwe. Abeegi, ku baareebire Mukama waabo, baashemererwa. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Yesu yaagaruka yaabagira ati: Mugire obusingye! Nk'oku Tata yantumire, naanye nikwo ndikubatuma. <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Ku yaagambire ekyo, yaabaikiza omwitsyo, ati: Mwakiire Omwoyo Orikwera. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:19">Mat 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:18">18:18</ref>. </char></note> Boona abu murisaasira ebibi, baryabisaasirwa; kandi abu murigumyaho ebibi, biryabagumaho.<verse eid="JHN 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okweyoreka abeegi be bari hamwe na Tomasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 11:16">Yoh 11:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 14:5">14:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka Tomasi, omwe ahari ikumi na babiri, orikwetwa Didumo, akaba atariho, obu Yesu yaija. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Abeegi abandi baamugira bati: Twareeba Mukama waitu. Kwonka we yaabagira ati: Ku ndaabe ntareebire nkojo z'emisumaari mu biganja bye, nkazitamu orukumu rwangye, nkata n'ekiganja kyangye omu rubaju rwe, tindiikiriza. <verse eid="JHN 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Ku haahingwireho ebiro munaana, nabwo abeegi be bari omu nju, kandi na Tomasi ari hamwe nabo. Yesu yaija enyigi zikingirwe, yaabeemerera ahagati, yaagira ati: Mugire obusingye. <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Yaagambira Tomasi ati: Reeta orukumu rwawe, n'ekiganja kyawe, okite omu rubaju rwangye; orekye kuba otaine kwikiriza, kureka oine okwikiriza. <verse eid="JHN 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Tomasi yaagarukamu yaamugira ati: Mukama wangye! Kandi Ruhanga wangye! <verse eid="JHN 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 1:8">1 Pet 1:8</ref>. </char></note> Yesu yaamugira ati: Waikiriza ahabw'okundeeba. Baine omugisha abaikiriza, bataine ki bareebire.<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Hariho n'eby'okureeberaho ebindi bingi, ebi Yesu yaakoreire omu maisho g'abeegi be, ebitahandiikirwe omu kitabo eki; <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 5:13">1 Yoh 5:13</ref>. </char></note> kwonka ebi bihandiikirwe ngu mwikirize ku Yesu ari Kristo Omwana wa Ruhanga, kandi ngu, ku muraikirize, mugire amagara omu iziina rye.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu okweyoreka abeegi be aha nyanja ya Tiberia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Bwanyima y'ebyo Yesu yaagaruka yaayeyoreka abeegi be aha nyanja ya Tiberia; kandi oku nikwo yaabeeyorekire. <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Simooni Petero, na Tomasi orikwetwa Didumo, na Nasanaeli owa Kaana eya Galilaaya, na beene Zebedaayo, n'abeegi be abandi babiri, bakaba bari hamwe. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Simooni Petero yaabagira ati: Ninza kujuba eby'enyanja. Baamugira bati: Naitwe nitugyenda naiwe. Baagyenda baaza omu bwato; kwonka ekiro ekyo tibaagira ki baakwata. <verse eid="JHN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:16">Luk 24:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:14">Yoh 20:14</ref>. </char></note> Ku bwabaire nibusheesha, Yesu yaayemerera aha nkungu; kwonka abeegi tibaamanya ku ariwe. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Yesu yaababuuza ati: Boojo, mwine eby'okurya? Baamugarukamu bati: Ngaaha! <verse eid="JHN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:4-7">Luk 5:4-7</ref>. </char></note> Yaabaragiira ati: Mutegye akatimba aha rubaju rwa buryo rw'obwato; nimwija kubikwata. Batyo baakatega, tibaabaasa kukaiha mu maizi ahabw'eby'enyanja kuba bingi. <verse eid="JHN 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Omwegi ogwo, ou Yesu yaabaire akunda, yaagambira Petero ati: Ni Mukama waitu. Simooni Petero, ku yaahuriire ngu ni Mukama waitu, yaajwara omwenda, ahakuba akaba ajwaire busha, yaayetuura omu nyanja. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Abeegi abandi baija omu bwato, nibakurura akatimba kaijwire eby'enyanja; ahakuba bakaba batari hare na nkungu, nk'entambwe igana.<verse eid="JHN 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Ku baahikire aha nkungu, baareebaho omuriro gw'amakara, guriho eby'enyanja, n'omugaati guri aha rubaju. <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Yesu yaabagira ati: Mureete aha eby'enyanja aha bi mwakwata hati. <verse eid="JHN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Simooni Petero yaaguruka omu bwato, yaakurura akatimba, yaakahitsya aha nkungu kaijwire eby'enyanja bihango igana na makumi ataano na bishatu; kwonka n'obu biraabe byabaire biri bingi bityo, akatimba tikaracwekire. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Yesu yaabeeta ati: Mwije murye. Kandi tihariho n'omwe aha beegi be owaateireho kumubuuza ati: Ori oha? Ahakuba bakamanya ku ari Mukama waabo. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Yesu yaija, yaakwata omugaati, yaagubaha, kandi n'eby'enyanja atyo. <verse eid="JHN 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Ogwo nigwo murundi gwa kashatu ogu Yesu yaareebekyeire abeegi be, aherize kuzooka omu bafu.<verse eid="JHN 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu okubuuza Petero eby'okumukunda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Ku baaherize kurya, Yesu yaabuuza Simooni Petero ati: Simooni mwene Yohaana, onkunda okukira aba? Yaamugarukamu ati: Eego, Mukama wangye; noomanya ku nkukunda. Yesu yaamugira ati: Riisa abaana b'entaama zangye. <verse eid="JHN 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 5:2">1 Pet 5:2</ref>. </char></note> Yesu yaamubuuza obwa kabiri ati: Simooni mwene Yohaana, onkunda? Yaamugarukamu ati: Eego, Mukama wangye; noomanya ku nkukunda. Yesu ati: Riisa entaama zangye. <verse eid="JHN 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Yaamubuuza obwa kashatu ati: Simooni, mwene Yohaana, onkunda? Petero yaashaasha ahabw'okumubuuza obwa kashatu ati: Onkunda? Yaamugira ati: Mukama wangye, iwe noomanya byona; noomanya ku nkukunda. Yesu yaamugira ati: Riisa entaama zangye. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Buzimazima ninkugambira nti: obu waabaire ori omutsigazi, okaba oyezirika, oza ei orikwenda yoona; kwonka ku oriba omugurusi, oryagorora emikono yaawe, ondiijo akuzirikye, akutware ei otarikwenda. <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:36">Yoh 13:36</ref>. </char></note> Ekyo akakigamba kworeka omuringo ogu arifamu oku gurihimbisisa Ruhanga. Bwanyima y'ekyo yaamugira ati: Nkurata.<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Petero, ku yaahindukire yaareeba omwegi ogwo, ou Yesu yaabaire akunda, abakuratiire; niwe owaabaire ayegamirie Yesu omu kufuba nibarya, obu yaamubuuza ati: Mukama wangye, n'oha orikuza kukureebya? <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Petero, ku yaamureebire, yaabuuza Yesu ati: Mukama wangye, ogu aryaba ata? <verse eid="JHN 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Yesu yaamugarukamu ati: Ku naakwenda ngu agumeho okuhitsya ahu ndiizira, noofa ki? Iwe nkuratira! <verse eid="JHN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Ekigambo ekyo kyabuga omu b'eishe-emwe, ku omwegi ogwo atarifa; kwonka Yesu taramugambiire ku atarifa, kureka ati: Ku naakwenda ngu agumeho okuhitsya ahu ndiizira, noofa ki?<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Ogwo niwe mwegi orikuhamya ebyo, kandi niwe yaabihandiikire; kandi nitumanya ngu okuhamya kwe n'okw'amazima. <verse eid="JHN 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Kandi hariho n'ebindi bingi ebi Yesu yaakozire; kuri noogira ngu byona bikahandiikwa buri kimwe, ninteekateeka nti, ebitabo ebyakuhandiikirwe bikaashaagire omu nsi.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>